1
00:00:14,033 --> 00:00:17,000
Tammy Faye: I THINK THE EYES
ARE SO IMPORTANT.

2
00:00:17,033 --> 00:00:20,467
I BELIEVE THEY ARE
THE EYES OF THE SOUL.
I TRULY DO.

3
00:00:20,501 --> 00:00:21,734
AND I THINK YOU CAN
LOOK IN SOMEONE'S EYES

4
00:00:21,767 --> 00:00:25,000
AND REALLY TELL
WHAT KIND OF A PERSON
AND WHAT THEIR HEART IS.

5
00:00:25,033 --> 00:00:28,166
AND SO WHEN MY PRECIOUS
FRIENDS DIE,

6
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:32,667
I ALWAYS ASK IF I COULD
PLEASE HAVE THEIR GLASSES.

7
00:00:35,834 --> 00:00:37,047
WHEN MY MOM DIED,

8
00:00:37,067 --> 00:00:38,834
I GOT MY MAMA'S GLASSES,

9
00:00:38,868 --> 00:00:41,234
AND THEY'RE VERY,
VERY PRECIOUS TO ME.

10
00:00:41,267 --> 00:00:43,400
I LIKE TO PUT THEM ON
SOMETIMES AND THINK,

11
00:00:43,434 --> 00:00:46,968
"YOU KNOW, MAMA
LOOKED THROUGH THESE.

12
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:08,300
RuPaul: TAMMY FAYE
IS THE FIRST LADY OF
RELIGIOUS BROADCASTING.

13
00:01:08,334 --> 00:01:10,634
TOGETHER, WITH HER
HUSBAND JIM BAKKER,

14
00:01:10,667 --> 00:01:13,567
SHE PIONEERED
THE ELECTRIC CHURCH.

15
00:01:13,601 --> 00:01:15,601
FROM THE SIXTIES
THROUGH THE MID-EIGHTIES,

16
00:01:15,634 --> 00:01:18,801
THEY BUILT NOT ONE,
BUT 3 RELIGIOUS NETWORKS,

17
00:01:18,834 --> 00:01:23,067
GROWING THE MEDIUM
FROM A MOTLEY GROUP
OF LOCAL STATIONS

18
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:27,067
INTO A GLOBAL CONCERN.

19
00:01:28,667 --> 00:01:30,834
AT THEIR PEAK, THEY
PRESIDED OVER THE LARGEST

20
00:01:30,868 --> 00:01:35,968
AND MOST SUCCESSFUL
CHRISTIAN TELEVISION
MINISTRY OF ITS DAY.

21
00:01:36,067 --> 00:01:38,968
THEIR CHRISTIAN RETREAT,
HERITAGE U.S.A.,

22
00:01:39,067 --> 00:01:41,501
WAS, AFTER DISNEY WORLD
AND DISNEYLAND,

23
00:01:41,534 --> 00:01:44,367
AMERICA'S MOST POPULAR
THEME PARK.

24
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:46,734
THEN, IN THE MID-EIGHTIES,

25
00:01:46,767 --> 00:01:48,968
THEIR WORLD CAME
CRASHING DOWN.

26
00:01:49,067 --> 00:01:50,267
Reporter: TROUBLES
FOR JIM BAKKER BEGAN

27
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:53,133
WITH THE REVELATION
OF HIS SEXUAL ENCOUNTER
WITH JESSICA HAHN.

28
00:01:53,167 --> 00:01:54,901
Second reporter:
TAMMY BAKKER CAME
OUT OF THE CLOSET

29
00:01:54,934 --> 00:01:57,167
TO REVEAL HERSELF
AS A DRUG ADDICT.

30
00:01:57,200 --> 00:02:00,133
WE DID NOT ASK
JERRY FALWELL

31
00:02:00,167 --> 00:02:01,534
TO TAKE OVER
OUR MINISTRY.

32
00:02:01,567 --> 00:02:05,601
Third reporter:
THE MINISTRY IS NOW STRUGGLING
WITH A $16-MILLION DEBT.

33
00:02:05,634 --> 00:02:07,100
THE U.S. BANKRUPTCY
COURT IS NOW...

34
00:02:07,133 --> 00:02:10,901
Fourth reporter:
THE GOVERNMENT SAID BAKKER
WAS A SLICK CON MAN,

35
00:02:10,934 --> 00:02:14,367
CHEATING HIS FOLLOWERS
OF MILLIONS OF DOLLARS.

36
00:02:18,601 --> 00:02:24,400
RuPaul: WHATEVER HAPPENED
TO TAMMY FAYE?

37
00:02:34,734 --> 00:02:38,300
12 LONG YEARS AFTER
HER FALL FROM GRACE,

38
00:02:38,334 --> 00:02:40,534
TAMMY LIVES
IN VIRTUAL EXILE

39
00:02:40,567 --> 00:02:44,934
IN A GATED COMMUNITY
IN PALM DESERT, CALIFORNIA.

40
00:02:44,968 --> 00:02:47,801
Tammy: OK, I'M GOING
TO READ YOU MY POEM.

41
00:02:47,834 --> 00:02:49,634
ARE YOU READY?

42
00:02:49,667 --> 00:02:53,667
"LONELINESS CLINGS TO ME
LIKE A SECOND SKIN,

43
00:02:53,701 --> 00:02:56,434
"THREATENING
TO SMOTHER ME
FROM WITHIN.

44
00:02:56,467 --> 00:02:57,901
"WHY GET READY
FOR THE DAY?

45
00:02:57,934 --> 00:03:00,834
"WHAT DOES IT MATTER
TO MYSELF, I SAY?

46
00:03:00,868 --> 00:03:03,567
"MY BODY ACHES ALL NIGHT,
ALL DAY,

47
00:03:03,601 --> 00:03:06,534
"AND I'M TOO TIRED
TO EVEN PRAY.

48
00:03:06,567 --> 00:03:09,400
"MUNDANE HOUSEHOLD
CHORES I DO,

49
00:03:09,434 --> 00:03:12,133
"VACUUM FLOORS
AND PICK UP POO.

50
00:03:12,167 --> 00:03:14,634
"I TRY NOT TO THINK
OF DAYS GONE BY,

51
00:03:14,667 --> 00:03:16,667
"TO DO SO ONLY
MAKES ME CRY.

52
00:03:16,701 --> 00:03:22,300
WHY ME, GOD, I SAY,
WHY?"

53
00:03:37,067 --> 00:03:38,934
IT'S A LITTLE
DRAMATIC, I GUESS,

54
00:03:38,968 --> 00:03:40,534
BUT IT'S HOW I FELT
AT THE TIME.

55
00:03:40,567 --> 00:03:44,133
I'VE OFTEN THOUGHT
I SHOULD PROBABLY
BE ON BROADWAY--

56
00:03:44,167 --> 00:03:47,334
[LAUGHS]
WITH ALL MY DRAMA.

57
00:03:50,634 --> 00:03:52,400
Both:...

58
00:04:00,567 --> 00:04:06,467
WHEN SHE WAS BORN,
SHE HAD PERFECTLY
MANICURED FINGERNAILS.

59
00:04:06,501 --> 00:04:08,300
RuPaul: THE ELDEST
OF 8 CHILDREN,

60
00:04:08,334 --> 00:04:12,901
TAMMY FAYE LaVALLEY
GREW UP IN INTERNATIONAL
FALLS, MINNESOTA.

61
00:04:12,934 --> 00:04:16,047
Virginia Fairchild:
THEIR HOUSE WAS BIG
ENOUGH FOR ALL OF THEM,

62
00:04:16,067 --> 00:04:17,767
BUT NOT A NICE ONE.

63
00:04:17,801 --> 00:04:19,667
IN THOSE DAYS,
YOU DIDN'T SPEND MONEY

64
00:04:19,701 --> 00:04:21,067
FOR ANYTHING
BUT FOOD AND CLOTHES,

65
00:04:21,100 --> 00:04:25,133
BECAUSE YOU JUST DIDN'T
HAVE IT, YOU KNOW?

66
00:04:25,167 --> 00:04:28,634
I DON'T THINK SHE HAD
A VERY HAPPY...

67
00:04:28,667 --> 00:04:30,901
GROWING-UP YEARS,
YOU KNOW?

68
00:04:30,934 --> 00:04:37,701
I MEAN, WHAT DID
SHE REALLY HAVE TO BE
OVERLY OVERJOYED ABOUT?

69
00:04:37,734 --> 00:04:40,767
I MEAN, HELPING
TAKE CARE OF KIDS, YEAH,

70
00:04:40,801 --> 00:04:42,434
BECAUSE SHE HAD TO.

71
00:04:42,467 --> 00:04:44,501
RuPaul: BUT EVEN
IN HER TEENS,

72
00:04:44,534 --> 00:04:46,834
TAMMY HAD HER FAITH
TO TURN TO.

73
00:04:46,868 --> 00:04:52,667
SHE HAD A LITTLE WART
ON ONE FINGER.

74
00:04:52,701 --> 00:04:55,868
SHE ASKED GOD,

75
00:04:55,901 --> 00:04:58,400
AND THE MESSAGE
THAT SHE GOT WAS,

76
00:04:58,434 --> 00:05:05,434
"PUT THAT FINGER
IN THE COMMUNION CUP
BEFORE YOU DRINK."

77
00:05:06,067 --> 00:05:07,334
AND SHE BROUGHT IT OUT,

78
00:05:07,367 --> 00:05:10,501
PARTOOK OF THE BREAD
AND THE JUICE,

79
00:05:10,534 --> 00:05:13,334
AND THE WART WAS GONE.

80
00:05:13,367 --> 00:05:16,534
WE HAD BEEN RAISED IN
THE ASSEMBLIES OF GOD.

81
00:05:16,567 --> 00:05:18,267
AND WE ALWAYS
SORT OF FELT

82
00:05:18,300 --> 00:05:19,934
THE ASSEMBLIES OF GOD
PREACHED THAT

83
00:05:19,968 --> 00:05:21,701
GOD WAS LOOKING DOWN
AT YOU FROM HEAVEN

84
00:05:21,734 --> 00:05:23,767
WITH A BIG HUGE
HAMMER IN HIS HAND

85
00:05:23,801 --> 00:05:24,901
AND THAT IF YOU DID
ANYTHING WRONG,

86
00:05:24,934 --> 00:05:27,100
HE WAS GOING TO HIT YOU
OVER THE HEAD WITH
THIS HAMMER

87
00:05:27,133 --> 00:05:28,934
AND SEND YOU
STRAIGHT TO HELL.

88
00:05:28,968 --> 00:05:36,067
Johnny Grover:
SHE WAS ALMOST SCARED
INTO STAYING CLOSE TO GOD.

89
00:05:37,467 --> 00:05:39,234
I STILL SAY ADA DEHREN
IS HER SAVIOR,

90
00:05:39,267 --> 00:05:43,400
BECAUSE SHE WAS THE ONE
THAT BOUGHT THE MAKE-UP
AT THE RUMMAGE SALE.

91
00:05:43,434 --> 00:05:47,634
[LAUGHS] THEY WERE
THE FIRST ONES TO TRY MAKE-UP.

92
00:05:48,267 --> 00:05:50,968
SEE ALL THIS STUFF?
LOOK AT ALL THIS STUFF.

93
00:05:51,067 --> 00:05:52,868
THAT'S MY BLUSH.
IT'S ALMOST GONE.

94
00:05:52,901 --> 00:05:54,734
I GOT TO GO
TO THE SWAP MEET
AND GET SOME MORE.

95
00:05:54,767 --> 00:05:56,067
I BUY IT AT
THE SWAP MEET.

96
00:05:56,100 --> 00:05:57,400
MY POWDER THAT
KIND OF--

97
00:05:57,434 --> 00:05:59,901
WHEN I CRY,
IT TAKES AWAY THE TEARS.

98
00:05:59,934 --> 00:06:01,267
THIS IS MY
EYEBROW STUFF,

99
00:06:01,300 --> 00:06:03,634
ALTHOUGH I DON'T
REALLY NEED TO PUT ON
EYEBROW STUFF,

100
00:06:03,667 --> 00:06:05,067
BECAUSE ME EYEBROWS
ARE PERMANENT.

101
00:06:05,100 --> 00:06:06,534
THIS TURNS PINK
WHEN YOU PUT IT ON.

102
00:06:06,567 --> 00:06:08,501
SEE? BUT IT'S WHITE
TO START WITH.

103
00:06:08,534 --> 00:06:09,501
EYELASH GLUE.

104
00:06:09,534 --> 00:06:11,100
OH, HERE'S--
I DON'T KNOW
WHAT THAT IS.

105
00:06:11,133 --> 00:06:13,300
OH, HERE'S MY MASCARA
THAT I'M SO FAMOUS FOR.

106
00:06:13,334 --> 00:06:16,934
AS YOU SEE, IT IS
L'OREAL WATERPROOF
LASH OUT MAKE-UP.

107
00:06:16,968 --> 00:06:21,200
AND, UM, AS YOU CAN SEE,
IT'S MUCH USED.

108
00:06:21,234 --> 00:06:23,334
MUCH LOVED.

109
00:06:25,133 --> 00:06:27,334
THEY ARE PUT ON SINGLY,

110
00:06:27,367 --> 00:06:30,067
AND, UH, WITH LOTS
OF MASCARA.

111
00:06:30,100 --> 00:06:31,334
THEY DON'T COME OFF,
I MEAN, THEY'RE...

112
00:06:31,367 --> 00:06:34,100
THEY HAVE TO,
LITERALLY,
KIND OF WEAR OFF.

113
00:06:34,133 --> 00:06:35,601
AND SO, ONCE IN A WHILE,
ONE WILL DROP OFF,

114
00:06:35,634 --> 00:06:38,667
AND WHEN IT DOES,
I PUT ANOTHER ONE IN.

115
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:41,300
WITHOUT MY EYELASHES,
I WOULDN'T BE TAMMY FAYE.

116
00:06:41,334 --> 00:06:45,767
I DON'T KNOW WHO I'D BE,
BUT I WOULDN'T BE ME.

117
00:06:55,701 --> 00:07:00,534
RuPaul: IN 1960, AGED 17,
TAMMY WENT TO BIBLE COLLEGE

118
00:07:00,567 --> 00:07:01,734
WHERE SHE MET
AND FELL IN LOVE

119
00:07:01,767 --> 00:07:05,367
WITH A YOUNG, CHARISMATIC
PREACHER NAMED JIM BAKKER.

120
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:11,067
THE NEXT YEAR,
ON APRIL FOOL'S DAY,
JIM AND TAMMY WERE MARRIED.

121
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:13,133
THE YOUNG NEWLYWEDS
LIVED ON THE ROAD,

122
00:07:13,167 --> 00:07:15,934
STRUGGLING TO MAKE A LIVING
AS ITINERANT PREACHERS,

123
00:07:15,968 --> 00:07:18,868
JOINING A TRADITION OF
TRAVELING EVANGELISM

124
00:07:18,901 --> 00:07:22,267
PIONEERED BY MINISTERS
LIKE ORAL ROBERTS.

125
00:07:22,300 --> 00:07:25,767
EVERYTHING THAT'S
EVERY BEEN DONE
THAT'S WORTHWHILE

126
00:07:25,801 --> 00:07:27,047
HAS BEEN DONE BY MEN,

127
00:07:27,067 --> 00:07:30,601
BY WOMEN WHO SAID,
"I DON'T CARE WHAT
THE COST IS,

128
00:07:30,634 --> 00:07:33,501
I'M GOING TO DO THIS
FOR THE GLORY OF GOD."

129
00:07:33,534 --> 00:07:35,834
RuPaul: A BLEND
OF CHRISTIANITY
AND SHOWMANSHIP,

130
00:07:35,868 --> 00:07:38,701
IT WAS A GROWING TREND
THAT WOULD CULMINATE

131
00:07:38,734 --> 00:07:41,868
IN THE CREATION
OF TELEVANGELISM...

132
00:07:42,667 --> 00:07:44,067
THE ELECTRIC CHURCH.

133
00:07:44,100 --> 00:07:49,334
TODAY, IT BOASTS OVER
2,500 RADIO AND TV STATIONS,

134
00:07:49,367 --> 00:07:54,400
REACHING AN
ESTIMATED AUDIENCE
OF 20 MILLION PEOPLE.

135
00:07:54,434 --> 00:07:55,834
SATELLITES CIRCLE THE GLOBE,

136
00:07:55,868 --> 00:07:58,167
BEAMING OUT THOUSANDS
OF PROGRAMS

137
00:07:58,200 --> 00:08:00,901
24 HOURS A DAY,
7 DAYS A WEEK,

138
00:08:00,934 --> 00:08:04,267
AND GENERATING MILLIONS
OF DOLLARS IN REVENUE.

139
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:06,200
Announcer: THE CHRISTIAN
SHOPPING NETWORK.

140
00:08:06,234 --> 00:08:08,200
THE ONLY NETWORK WHERE
YOU SOW THE KINGDOM OF GOD,

141
00:08:08,234 --> 00:08:11,567
WHILE YOU PURCHASE
YOUR FAVORITE PRODUCTS
AT LOWER THAN RETAIL PRICE...

142
00:08:11,601 --> 00:08:16,047
RuPaul: BUT IT ALL
STARTED OUT WITH PUPPETS,

143
00:08:16,067 --> 00:08:17,667
JIM AND TAMMY'S PUPPETS.

144
00:08:17,701 --> 00:08:20,501
OH, YEAH, WE PRACTICALLY
STARTED THE ELECTRIC CHURCH.

145
00:08:20,534 --> 00:08:22,834
WE HAD BOUGHT SILKY
BUBBLE BATH, OF ALL THINGS,

146
00:08:22,868 --> 00:08:25,567
AND WE SAW THESE LITTLE
HEADS ON THE BUBBLE BATH,

147
00:08:25,601 --> 00:08:28,400
AND I--I STARTED
TALKING FOR THEM.

148
00:08:28,434 --> 00:08:29,601
YOU KNOW, MAKING
LITTLE VOICES.

149
00:08:29,634 --> 00:08:30,868
[IN A SILLY VOICE]
"HELLO, THERE."

150
00:08:30,901 --> 00:08:32,234
THOSE KINDS OF
LITTLE VOICES.

151
00:08:32,267 --> 00:08:35,100
AND JIM SAID, "TAMMY,
WE COULD MAKE PUPPETS
OUT OF THESE THINGS,

152
00:08:35,133 --> 00:08:38,367
AND WE COULD USE THEM
IN CHURCH FOR THE KIDS."

153
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,434
WE TOOK THE SILKY
BUBBLE BATH, IT WAS PORKY PIG,

154
00:08:40,467 --> 00:08:44,467
WE MELTED THE EARS DOWN
AND MADE A LITTLE GIRL PIGGY.

155
00:08:44,501 --> 00:08:45,467
SHE HAD TO HAVE A FRIEND,

156
00:08:45,501 --> 00:08:47,133
SO WE MADE AN ALLIGATOR
THAT TALKED LIKE THIS,

157
00:08:47,167 --> 00:08:49,267
[LOW-PITCHED VOICE]
"HELLO.
I'M ALLIE THE ALLIGATOR.

158
00:08:49,300 --> 00:08:50,734
[HIGH-PITCHED VOICE]
"AND I'M SUSIE MUPPET."

159
00:08:50,767 --> 00:08:53,534
I WORKED THEM WITH
MY HANDS, LIKE THIS.

160
00:08:53,567 --> 00:08:56,047
THIS WAS THEIR LITTLE HANDS,
AND THIS WAS THEIR HEAD.

161
00:08:56,067 --> 00:08:58,267
♪ JESUS TAKES A FROWN ♪

162
00:08:58,300 --> 00:09:01,834
♪ AND HE TURNS IT
UPSIDE DOWN ♪

163
00:09:01,868 --> 00:09:03,467
♪ AND OOPS! ♪

164
00:09:03,501 --> 00:09:07,234
♪ HERE COMES
A SMILE... ♪

165
00:09:07,267 --> 00:09:09,167
RuPaul: SUSIE MUPPET
AND ALLIE THE ALLIGATOR

166
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:13,267
ATTRACTED THE ATTENTION OF
TV MINISTER PAT ROBERTSON.

167
00:09:13,300 --> 00:09:14,968
HE RAN A SMALL LOCAL STATION

168
00:09:15,067 --> 00:09:18,801
AND DREAMT OF
BUILDING A CHRISTIAN
BROADCASTING NETWORK.

169
00:09:18,834 --> 00:09:21,100
Jim Bakker:
WE GOT A CALL
FROM PAT ROBERTSON.

170
00:09:21,133 --> 00:09:23,734
HE WANTED
TO MEET WITH US.
AND HE SAID,

171
00:09:23,767 --> 00:09:27,167
"WOULD YOU CONSIDER
JOINING THE NETWORK?"

172
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:29,601
WELL, THE NETWORK
WAS ONE STATION,

173
00:09:29,634 --> 00:09:32,968
A ONE-KILOWATT
TELEVISION STATION.

174
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:34,701
IT HARDLY WENT DOWN
THE BLOCK AT TIMES.

175
00:09:34,734 --> 00:09:38,667
Announcer:
IT'S TIME FOR THE NATIONS
BIGGEST YARD PARTY,

176
00:09:38,701 --> 00:09:41,667
THE JIM & TAMMY SHOW.

177
00:09:41,701 --> 00:09:42,767
HI, EVERYBODY!

178
00:09:42,801 --> 00:09:45,601
All: HI,
JIM AND TAMMY!

179
00:09:45,634 --> 00:09:47,033
Jim Bakker: WE DID NOT
HAVE A SCRIPT,

180
00:09:47,067 --> 00:09:48,434
SO EVERYTHING WAS
REALLY AD-LIBBED.

181
00:09:48,467 --> 00:09:51,767
I THINK JIM, ACTUALLY,
WAS A LITTLE NERVOUS
AROUND THE PUPPETS,

182
00:09:51,801 --> 00:09:55,434
BECAUSE HE NEVER REALLY KNEW
WHAT THEY WERE GOING TO SAY.

183
00:09:55,467 --> 00:09:57,400
JIM, YOU JUST ATE
MY SHRIMP UP.

184
00:09:57,434 --> 00:09:59,901
[GASPS] OH, I WAS
JUST STANDING HERE--

185
00:09:59,934 --> 00:10:00,901
SHUT UP!

186
00:10:00,934 --> 00:10:04,133
Jim: SUSIE WAS
THE BAD TAMMY FAYE,

187
00:10:04,167 --> 00:10:05,501
AND ALLIE WAS ALWAYS
SOMEHOW--

188
00:10:05,534 --> 00:10:06,934
SHE HAD A SPLIT
PERSONALITY,

189
00:10:06,968 --> 00:10:08,234
'CAUSE ALLIE WAS
ALWAYS NICE TO ME,

190
00:10:08,267 --> 00:10:12,367
BUT SUSIE MUPPET WAS
ALWAYS ARGUING WITH ME.

191
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:14,067
AND I MEAN, IF THOSE
PEOPLE AT HOME,

192
00:10:14,100 --> 00:10:16,801
I DON'T KNOW
IF THEY KNEW...

193
00:10:16,834 --> 00:10:18,667
WE WERE HAVING
LEGITIMATE FIGHTS,

194
00:10:18,701 --> 00:10:20,968
ONLY WE WERE DOING IT
THROUGH THESE PUPPETS.

195
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,000
BUT FOR SOME REASON,

196
00:10:22,033 --> 00:10:26,400
THE SHOW BECAME
THE NUMBER ONE PROGRAM
ON C.B.N.

197
00:10:26,434 --> 00:10:28,667
♪ I'M GOING
TO LOVE MY ENEMIES ♪

198
00:10:28,701 --> 00:10:32,767
♪ DO GOOD TO THOSE
WHO ARE BAD TO ME ♪

199
00:10:32,801 --> 00:10:34,200
♪ GOING TO LOVE... ♪

200
00:10:34,234 --> 00:10:36,667
I MEAN,
WHAT DID JIM HENSON HAVE

201
00:10:36,701 --> 00:10:40,067
BUT JIM AND TAMMY
GONE BERSERK.

202
00:10:40,100 --> 00:10:45,047
♪ SO GOOD AND FREE ♪

203
00:10:45,067 --> 00:10:47,367
♪ SO GOOD AND FREE ♪

204
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:50,047
RuPaul: JIM AND TAMMY
HAD AGREED TO WORK
FOR PAT ROBERTSON

205
00:10:50,067 --> 00:10:54,067
ON CONDITION THAT
THEY COULD ALSO START
A LATE-NIGHT TALK SHOW.

206
00:10:54,100 --> 00:10:55,901
HE SAID, "I'LL MAKE
A DEAL WITH YOU.

207
00:10:55,934 --> 00:10:58,367
"IF YOU GET THE KID SHOW
UP AND RUNNING,

208
00:10:58,400 --> 00:11:01,400
THEN YOU CAN DO THIS
LATE-NIGHT SHOW."

209
00:11:01,434 --> 00:11:02,701
AND SO PAT HONORED
HIS WORD ON THAT,

210
00:11:02,734 --> 00:11:07,534
AND JIM STARTED
WHAT WAS CALLED THE 700 CLUB,

211
00:11:07,567 --> 00:11:10,534
THE FIRST CHRISTIAN
TALK SHOW IN HISTORY.

212
00:11:10,567 --> 00:11:13,934
Announcer: SO HERE'S
YOUR HOST ON...

213
00:11:15,868 --> 00:11:18,701
HELLO, AND WELCOME
TO THE 700 CLUB TODAY.

214
00:11:18,734 --> 00:11:20,901
I'M SO VERY,
VERY HAPPY THAT
YOU COULD JOIN US

215
00:11:20,934 --> 00:11:23,634
FOR THIS PROGRAM
OF PRAYER AND PRAISE.

216
00:11:23,667 --> 00:11:27,767
RuPaul: THE INSTANT
SUCCESS OF THE 700 CLUB
AND THE JIM AND TAMMY SHOW,

217
00:11:27,801 --> 00:11:30,067
HELPED TURN THE CHRISTIAN
BROADCAST NETWORK

218
00:11:30,100 --> 00:11:35,634
FROM A LOCAL STATION
INTO A FULL-FLEDGED NETWORK.

219
00:11:36,701 --> 00:11:39,300
BUT THINGS BEGAN TO SOUR.

220
00:11:39,334 --> 00:11:41,167
Tammy: PAT BEGAN TO WANT
TO TAKE OVER SOME OF
THE 700 CLUB,

221
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:44,901
WHICH WAS FINE,
BECAUSE IT WAS HIS STATION
AND WE HONORED HIM FOR THAT.

222
00:11:44,934 --> 00:11:46,267
AND SO, WE JUST SAID, "PAT,

223
00:11:46,300 --> 00:11:48,801
"YOU'RE ABLE TO DO IT
BY YOURSELF NOW.
YOU DON'T NEED US."

224
00:11:48,834 --> 00:11:51,100
AND SO WE DECIDED TO MOVE ON
AND DO OUR OWN THING.

225
00:11:51,133 --> 00:11:54,067
THE 700 CLUB TODAY
IS PROBABLY

226
00:11:54,100 --> 00:11:58,501
THE MOST POWERFUL
OF THE RELIGIOUS
BROADCASTS.

227
00:11:58,534 --> 00:11:59,968
Announcer: THIS IS...

228
00:12:00,067 --> 00:12:04,167
Reverend White:
AND JIM WAS THE FIRST
HOST ON THE 700 CLUB,

229
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:06,501
BEFORE
PAT ROBERTSON WAS.

230
00:12:07,701 --> 00:12:09,367
RuPaul: TAMMY WROTE
TO PAT ROBERTSON

231
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:14,234
ASKING HIM TO BE INTERVIEWED
FOR THIS DOCUMENTARY.

232
00:12:14,267 --> 00:12:17,167
HE DECLINED.

233
00:12:26,834 --> 00:12:29,767
JIM AND TAMMY THEN MOVED
WEST TO CALIFORNIA,

234
00:12:29,801 --> 00:12:31,133
AND IN THE KITCHEN
OF THEIR RENTED HOME

235
00:12:31,167 --> 00:12:33,801
WITH THEIR FRIENDS
JAN AND PAUL CROUCH,

236
00:12:33,834 --> 00:12:35,133
THEY LAUNCHED
A NEW VENTURE:

237
00:12:35,167 --> 00:12:37,267
THE TRINITY BROADCAST
NETWORK.

238
00:12:37,300 --> 00:12:39,968
Tammy: JIM WAS THE HOST,
AND I WAS THE CO-HOST,

239
00:12:40,067 --> 00:12:43,934
AND JAN AND PAUL WERE
IN THE BACKGROUND.

240
00:12:43,968 --> 00:12:45,834
RuPaul: BUT NOT FOR LONG.

241
00:12:45,868 --> 00:12:47,367
JIM AND TAMMY
WERE FORCED OUT

242
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:50,601
IN A BOARD-ROOM COUP
BY JAN AND PAUL CROUCH.

243
00:12:50,634 --> 00:12:52,834
Announcer: THIS IS THE TRINITY
BROADCASTING NETWORK,

244
00:12:52,868 --> 00:12:55,968
CELEBRATING OUR
25th ANNIVERSARY.

245
00:12:56,067 --> 00:12:57,801
RuPaul: TODAY,
THE CROUCHS STILL PRESIDE

246
00:12:57,834 --> 00:12:59,534
OVER THE MINISTRY JIM
AND TAMMY STARTED WITH THEM,

247
00:12:59,567 --> 00:13:04,267
WHICH HAS SINCE
BECOME ONE OF THE WORLD'S
LARGEST TV MINISTRIES.

248
00:13:04,300 --> 00:13:06,968
JIM AND TAMMY STARTED
ALMOST EVERYTHING

249
00:13:07,067 --> 00:13:10,167
THAT IS NOW POWERFUL IN
RELIGIOUS TELECASTING.

250
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:12,968
BUT AS SOON AS
THEY GOT IT BUILT,
LIKE AT TBN,

251
00:13:13,067 --> 00:13:15,047
AS SOON AS THEY GOT
PEOPLE WATCHING,

252
00:13:15,067 --> 00:13:17,067
AS SOON AS THEY GOT
THE AUDIENCE CAPTIVATED,

253
00:13:17,100 --> 00:13:19,400
AS SOON AS THEY BEGAN
TO GET POWER,

254
00:13:19,434 --> 00:13:22,300
THEY WERE,
KIND OF, LET GO.

255
00:13:23,767 --> 00:13:24,934
RuPaul: TAMMY WROTE
TO THE CROUCHS

256
00:13:24,968 --> 00:13:28,767
ASKING THEM
TO BE INTERVIEWED
FOR THIS DOCUMENTARY.

257
00:13:28,801 --> 00:13:31,400
THEY DECLINED.

258
00:13:39,167 --> 00:13:42,167
Choir: ♪ GLORIA ♪

259
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:43,267
RuPaul: IN 1974,

260
00:13:43,300 --> 00:13:46,934
JIM AND TAMMY
MOVED TO CHARLOTTE,
NORTH CAROLINA.

261
00:13:46,968 --> 00:13:48,400
Announcer: STAND BY.
5 SECONDS TO PTL.

262
00:13:48,434 --> 00:13:51,868
RuPaul: THERE, THEY LAUNCHED
A THIRD TELEVISION NETWORK

263
00:13:51,901 --> 00:13:53,767
CALLED P.T.L...

264
00:13:53,801 --> 00:13:56,100
PRAISE THE LORD.

265
00:13:56,133 --> 00:13:57,901
[APPLAUSE]
Choir: ♪ PRAISE THE LORD ♪

266
00:13:57,934 --> 00:14:01,267
♪ NOW'S THE TIME
TO LIFT OUR VOICES ♪

267
00:14:01,300 --> 00:14:02,467
THIS WAS THE FIRST TIME

268
00:14:02,501 --> 00:14:03,667
THAT THEY WERE
COMPLETELY IN CHARGE

269
00:14:03,701 --> 00:14:07,567
AND FREE TO CREATE
THEIR OWN NETWORK
IN THEIR OWN IMAGE.

270
00:14:07,601 --> 00:14:10,734
♪ WELL, I FOUND
A NEW JOY ♪

271
00:14:10,767 --> 00:14:11,801
COME ON, JIM!

272
00:14:11,834 --> 00:14:14,300
Tammy: WE BELIEVED THAT
CHRISTIANITY SHOULD BE FUN.

273
00:14:14,334 --> 00:14:15,968
WE BELIEVED
IT SHOULD BE JOYFUL.

274
00:14:16,067 --> 00:14:18,367
AND I THINK WE WERE
ONE OF THE FIRST PEOPLE

275
00:14:18,400 --> 00:14:21,567
TO PUT FUN AND LAUGHTER
IN CHRISTIANITY.

276
00:14:21,601 --> 00:14:24,400
IT'S NOT A DRAG
TO BE SAVED.

277
00:14:24,434 --> 00:14:27,100
IT'S NOT A BORING THING.
THAT'S RELIGION.

278
00:14:27,133 --> 00:14:29,300
YOU SEE, YOU'VE
GOTTEN IT MIXED UP.

279
00:14:29,334 --> 00:14:31,767
RELIGION IS BORING
AND DULL...

280
00:14:31,801 --> 00:14:33,667
MOST OF THE TIME,

281
00:14:33,701 --> 00:14:35,434
BUT JESUS IS LIFE.

282
00:14:35,467 --> 00:14:36,567
♪ ...GLORIOUS,
WONDERFUL DAY ♪

283
00:14:36,601 --> 00:14:41,100
♪ YES, IT'S A MARVELOUS,
GLORIOUS, WONDERFUL DAY ♪

284
00:14:41,133 --> 00:14:47,300
♪ TO SERVE THE LORD ♪

285
00:14:47,334 --> 00:14:49,601
♪ HALLELUJAH ♪

286
00:14:49,634 --> 00:14:51,501
PRAISE THE LORD.

287
00:14:51,534 --> 00:14:53,200
HALLELUJAH.
WHOO!

288
00:14:53,234 --> 00:14:57,868
RuPaul: JIM AND TAMMY'S
GOSPEL OF FUN WAS FOR
ONE AND ALL.

289
00:14:57,901 --> 00:14:59,467
Tammy: WE WERE
INTER-DENOMINATIONAL,

290
00:14:59,501 --> 00:15:01,334
FOR EVERYONE
OF EVERY DENOMINATION.

291
00:15:01,367 --> 00:15:03,467
THE LUTHERANS,
THE BAPTISTS, CATHOLICS,

292
00:15:03,501 --> 00:15:06,934
ALL DENOMINATIONS WERE
A PART OF PTL.

293
00:15:06,968 --> 00:15:10,567
AND REMEMBER,
GOD LOVES YOU.

294
00:15:10,601 --> 00:15:11,901
HE REALLY DOES.

295
00:15:11,934 --> 00:15:13,868
GOD LOVES YOU.

296
00:15:13,901 --> 00:15:15,234
HE LOVES YOU.

297
00:15:15,267 --> 00:15:16,234
GOD LOVES YOU!
HE REALLY DOES!

298
00:15:16,267 --> 00:15:17,734
GOD LOVES YOU.

299
00:15:17,767 --> 00:15:20,100
HE REALLY DOES.
BYE-BYE FOR TODAY.

300
00:15:20,133 --> 00:15:21,601
RuPaul:
PTL EMBRACED THOSE

301
00:15:21,634 --> 00:15:23,567
THAT OTHER CHRISTIAN
FUNDAMENTALISTS

302
00:15:23,601 --> 00:15:25,567
AND TELEVANGELISTS
REJECTED.

303
00:15:25,601 --> 00:15:26,701
STEVE IS A PATIENT
OF AIDS,

304
00:15:26,734 --> 00:15:31,300
AND HE SO GENEROUSLY
ALLOWED US TO TALK
TO HIM TODAY.

305
00:15:31,334 --> 00:15:32,467
WAS IT JUST
A WORD TO YOU?

306
00:15:32,501 --> 00:15:33,601
IS IT SOMETHING
THAT JUST HAPPENS

307
00:15:33,634 --> 00:15:34,834
TO OTHER PEOPLE
AND NOT TO STEVE?

308
00:15:34,868 --> 00:15:38,701
I KNEW THAT IT WAS
A GROWING PROBLEM
IN THE GAY COMMUNITY,

309
00:15:38,734 --> 00:15:43,634
BUT I, AS MANY OTHER PEOPLE
DID BACK IN 1981 AND '82,

310
00:15:43,667 --> 00:15:45,267
DENIED THAT
IT COULD TOUCH ME.

311
00:15:45,300 --> 00:15:46,267
I MEAN,
WE DIDN'T SEE HOW--

312
00:15:46,300 --> 00:15:47,868
I MEAN,
WHY WOULD IT HURT ME?

313
00:15:47,901 --> 00:15:49,567
I WAS A GOOD
CHRISTIAN PASTOR.

314
00:15:49,601 --> 00:15:51,701
DO YOU KNOW HOW
EARLY THAT WAS

315
00:15:51,734 --> 00:15:52,968
FOR ANYBODY IN
THE CHRISTIAN WORLD

316
00:15:53,067 --> 00:15:56,467
TO BE REACHING OUT
AND TO BE EMBRACING
A GAY PERSON,

317
00:15:56,501 --> 00:15:58,467
LET ALONE
A PERSON WITH AIDS?

318
00:15:58,501 --> 00:16:00,133
TAMMY BAKKER DID IT

319
00:16:00,167 --> 00:16:02,133
WHEN NO ONE ELSE
WOULD DO IT.

320
00:16:02,167 --> 00:16:05,501
HOW SAD THAT
WE AS CHRISTIANS,

321
00:16:05,534 --> 00:16:07,234
WHO ARE TO BE
THE SALT OF THE EARTH,

322
00:16:07,267 --> 00:16:13,047
AND WE ARE--WE,
WHO ARE SUPPOSED TO BE
ABLE TO LOVE EVERYONE,

323
00:16:13,067 --> 00:16:16,200
ARE AFRAID SO BADLY
OF AN AIDS PATIENT

324
00:16:16,234 --> 00:16:19,868
THAT WE WILL NOT
GO UP AND PUT OUR
ARM AROUND THEM

325
00:16:19,901 --> 00:16:21,167
AND TELL THEM
THAT WE CARE?

326
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:24,901
RuPaul: WHETHER
IT WAS AIDS, DRUG ABUSE,
OR MARRIAGE COUNSELING,

327
00:16:24,934 --> 00:16:27,167
PTL, AND IN PARTICULAR
TAMMY,

328
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:31,234
RUSHED IN WHERE OTHER
CHRISTIAN BROADCASTERS
FEARED TO TREAD.

329
00:16:31,267 --> 00:16:33,467
THE PENILE IMPLANT
OF THE INFLATABLE TYPE,

330
00:16:33,501 --> 00:16:34,701
AND THAT'S THE ONE THAT
WE'RE LOOKING AT--

331
00:16:34,734 --> 00:16:36,667
IT'S THE NEWEST ONE, RIGHT?
THIS IS THE NEWEST ONE
OUT THERE.

332
00:16:36,701 --> 00:16:39,467
WHEN HE WANTS
TO BECOME ERECT,
HE REACHES DOWN,

333
00:16:39,501 --> 00:16:42,067
HE SQUEEZES THAT
SEVERAL TIMES,

334
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:44,167
AND THE MAN
BECOMES FIRM.

335
00:16:44,200 --> 00:16:45,467
I THINK THAT'S FANTASTIC.

336
00:16:45,501 --> 00:16:47,467
NOW GO AHEAD, AUDIENCE,
GO AHEAD.

337
00:16:47,501 --> 00:16:49,501
I'VE BEEN IN HOLLYWOOD,
AND IN NEW YORK,

338
00:16:49,534 --> 00:16:51,234
AND I'D SEEN
THE NETWORKS PRODUCE,

339
00:16:51,267 --> 00:16:54,501
BUT THERE WERE
NO PRODUCERS LIKE TAMMY.

340
00:16:54,534 --> 00:16:56,601
♪ OH, WELL, NOW ♪

341
00:16:56,634 --> 00:17:02,801
♪ WHO'S THAT BOUNCING AROUND
LIKE A PING-PONG BALL? ♪

342
00:17:02,834 --> 00:17:05,047
♪ WHO'S THAT,
BIGGER THAN LIFE ♪

343
00:17:05,067 --> 00:17:06,534
♪ EVEN THOUGH
SHE'S SMALL... ♪

344
00:17:06,567 --> 00:17:07,834
Reverend White:
THE FIRST DAY I SAW HER,

345
00:17:07,868 --> 00:17:09,734
I WATCHED HER DO
3 DIFFERENT SHOWS,

346
00:17:09,767 --> 00:17:11,734
HOUR-LONG SHOWS
IN A ROW,

347
00:17:11,767 --> 00:17:12,901
WITHOUT A TELEPROMPTER,

348
00:17:12,934 --> 00:17:14,200
WITHOUT NOTES,

349
00:17:14,234 --> 00:17:15,767
JUST KEEPING IT GOING.

350
00:17:15,801 --> 00:17:16,834
♪ IT'S TAMMY ♪

351
00:17:16,868 --> 00:17:18,200
♪ A DOUBLE-WHAMMY ♪

352
00:17:18,234 --> 00:17:24,400
♪ OF TURNED-ON
CHRISTIAN LOVE ♪

353
00:17:25,834 --> 00:17:27,701
RuPaul: WHEN NOT
IN FRONT OF A CAMERA,

354
00:17:27,734 --> 00:17:29,701
TAMMY WAS BEHIND
A MICROPHONE

355
00:17:29,734 --> 00:17:32,667
RECORDING OVER 40 ALBUMS.

356
00:17:33,100 --> 00:17:35,300
Announcer:
TAMMY FAYE...

357
00:17:35,334 --> 00:17:36,901
WARM...

358
00:17:36,934 --> 00:17:38,968
GENTLE...

359
00:17:39,067 --> 00:17:40,734
RADIANT...

360
00:17:40,767 --> 00:17:41,968
BLESSED.

361
00:17:42,067 --> 00:17:44,067
A GLOWING EXAMPLE.

362
00:17:44,100 --> 00:17:46,200
FOR YOUR COPY OF HER
MOST RECENT ALBUM,

363
00:17:46,234 --> 00:17:49,167
SEND $25 TODAY
TO JIM BAKKER...

364
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:51,067
RuPaul: AND IN BETWEEN
RECORDING ALBUMS,

365
00:17:51,100 --> 00:17:54,234
SHE RAISED A FAMILY...
ALSO ON TELEVISION.

366
00:17:54,267 --> 00:17:57,534
I WANT YOU TO MEET MY BOY--

367
00:17:57,567 --> 00:17:59,601
JAMIE CHARLES BAKKER.

368
00:17:59,634 --> 00:18:02,667
[APPLAUSE]
Tammy: WE IDENTIFIED WITH
THE AMERICAN FAMILY,

369
00:18:02,701 --> 00:18:04,367
AND THEY IDENTIFIED
WITH US.

370
00:18:04,400 --> 00:18:07,234
I PRACTICALLY HAD BOTH
MY CHILDREN ON TV.

371
00:18:07,267 --> 00:18:11,734
BEFORE I WAS BORN,
I WAS ON TELEVISION.

372
00:18:11,767 --> 00:18:14,047
IN MY MOTHER'S STOMACH,

373
00:18:14,067 --> 00:18:15,467
I WAS ON TELEVISION.

374
00:18:15,501 --> 00:18:19,834
SO MY WHOLE LIFE HAS
BEEN IN FRONT OF PEOPLE.

375
00:18:19,868 --> 00:18:20,834
[APPLAUSE]

376
00:18:20,868 --> 00:18:22,901
Jamie: SO MANY PEOPLE NOW,
EVEN TO THIS DAY,

377
00:18:22,934 --> 00:18:23,968
COME UP,
AND THEY'RE LIKE,

378
00:18:24,067 --> 00:18:26,801
"I REMEMBER YOU FROM WHEN
YOU WERE A LITTLE KID.

379
00:18:26,834 --> 00:18:29,234
I GREW UP WITH YOU.
I FEEL LIKE I'M A PART OF YOU."

380
00:18:29,267 --> 00:18:32,067
AND IT'S BECAUSE
THEY GREW UP IN OUR HOUSE,

381
00:18:32,100 --> 00:18:33,534
I MEAN, IN OUR LIVES.

382
00:18:33,567 --> 00:18:35,667
MY LANDS!

383
00:18:35,701 --> 00:18:38,767
Jamie Bakker: IT WAS
VERY NORMAL TO HAVE CAMERAS

384
00:18:38,801 --> 00:18:40,434
AROUND THE HOUSE
DURING CHRISTMAS.

385
00:18:40,467 --> 00:18:41,434
THIS WAS LIFE TO ME.

386
00:18:41,467 --> 00:18:42,968
Tammy: WE WERE PART
OF THEIR FAMILIES.

387
00:18:43,067 --> 00:18:46,868
WE LOVED THEM, AND THEY
LOVED US AS FAMILY PEOPLE.

388
00:18:46,901 --> 00:18:48,834
AND I THINK THAT'S WHY
IT WAS SO POWERFUL.

389
00:18:48,868 --> 00:18:54,200
RuPaul: THE PRAISE THE LORD
NETWORK TOOK OFF.

390
00:18:54,234 --> 00:18:55,400
FROM THIS MOMENT ON,

391
00:18:55,434 --> 00:19:01,047
THE PTL
TELEVISION NETWORK
PLANS TO BROADCAST...

392
00:19:01,067 --> 00:19:02,834
24 HOURS A DAY...

393
00:19:02,868 --> 00:19:05,434
UNTIL THE SECOND
COMING OF JESUS CHRIST.

394
00:19:05,467 --> 00:19:09,667
♪ JESUS KEEPS ON TAKING ME
HIGHER AND HIGHER ♪

395
00:19:09,701 --> 00:19:11,047
♪ HIGHER AND HIGHER ♪

396
00:19:11,067 --> 00:19:12,501
♪ HIGHER AND HIGHER ♪

397
00:19:12,534 --> 00:19:13,534
♪ JESUS KEEPS... ♪

398
00:19:13,567 --> 00:19:17,267
WE KEPT ADDING STATION
AFTER STATION AFTER STATION,

399
00:19:17,300 --> 00:19:19,047
AND IT WAS AN AWESOME
THING THAT HAPPENED.

400
00:19:19,067 --> 00:19:20,968
Jim: ALL OVER THE WORLD,
WE WERE DOING TELEVISION.

401
00:19:21,067 --> 00:19:28,067
WE WERE ONE OF THE FIRST
4 SATELLITE NETWORKS
IN THE WORLD.

402
00:19:29,234 --> 00:19:33,334
Announcer:
YOU'RE WATCHING...

403
00:19:33,367 --> 00:19:34,801
THAT'S WHY LATER ON,

404
00:19:34,834 --> 00:19:38,334
THE PLUM THAT SO MANY
PEOPLE WANTED

405
00:19:38,367 --> 00:19:41,133
WAS THAT SATELLITE.

406
00:19:41,767 --> 00:19:45,667
RuPaul: BUT JIM WASN'T
SATISFIED WITH JUST
A TELEVISION NETWORK.

407
00:19:45,701 --> 00:19:49,033
Tammy:
JIM FELT THAT IF THE PEOPLE
WERE THERE ON THE GROUNDS

408
00:19:49,067 --> 00:19:52,000
AND COULD COME AND STAY
WHERE PTL WAS AND SEE,

409
00:19:52,033 --> 00:19:53,801
AND GET IN ON THE VISION...

410
00:19:53,834 --> 00:19:54,934
THAT'S WHAT HE WANTED.

411
00:19:54,968 --> 00:19:58,400
HE WANTED ALL THE PEOPLE
TO BE ABLE TO ACTUALLY BE THERE.

412
00:19:58,434 --> 00:20:00,000
RuPaul:
TO REALIZE THIS VISION,

413
00:20:00,033 --> 00:20:03,501
JIM BAKKER CONTACTED HIS
CHURCH BUILDER ROE MESSNER.

414
00:20:03,534 --> 00:20:06,968
Roe: I GOT ON A PLANE
AND WENT DOWN
TO CHARLOTTE,

415
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:08,100
MET WITH JIM,

416
00:20:08,133 --> 00:20:10,467
AND HE LAID OUT THIS
GRANDIOSE PLAN

417
00:20:10,501 --> 00:20:12,434
THAT HE HAD FOR
2,500 ACRES

418
00:20:12,467 --> 00:20:14,501
AND WANTED TO KNOW
IF I WOULD, UH,

419
00:20:14,534 --> 00:20:18,434
DESIGN HIS BUILDINGS
AND BE HIS CONTRACTOR.

420
00:20:18,467 --> 00:20:19,834
RuPaul:
WHAT JIM ENVISIONED

421
00:20:19,868 --> 00:20:22,734
WAS NOTHING LESS THAN
A CHRISTIAN DISNEYLAND,

422
00:20:22,767 --> 00:20:24,400
A MULTI-MILLION DOLLAR
RESORT

423
00:20:24,434 --> 00:20:28,033
THAT WOULD EVENTUALLY
INCLUDE A 500-ROOM HOTEL,

424
00:20:28,067 --> 00:20:30,934
A STATE-OF-THE-ART
BROADCAST FACILITY,

425
00:20:30,968 --> 00:20:33,934
AND A WATER PARK.

426
00:20:33,968 --> 00:20:37,067
♪ PRAISE THE LORD ♪

427
00:20:37,100 --> 00:20:40,934
♪ EVERYBODY
LIFT OUR VOICES... ♪

428
00:20:40,968 --> 00:20:44,267
WELL, PART OF THE EXCITEMENT
OF HERITAGE U.S.A., I BELIEVE,

429
00:20:44,300 --> 00:20:45,968
WAS PEOPLE WATCHING
THE BUILDINGS GOING UP.

430
00:20:46,067 --> 00:20:50,400
AND I DON'T THINK MAYBE
I UNDERSTOOD THAT AS WELL
AS I WISH I WOULD HAVE.

431
00:20:50,434 --> 00:20:53,734
I GOT TO WHERE
I COULDN'T STAND TO HEAR
THE NAME ROE MESSNER.

432
00:20:53,767 --> 00:20:55,047
BECAUSE I--FOR ONE THING,

433
00:20:55,067 --> 00:20:59,267
I KNEW THAT BUILDINGS MEANT
RAISING LOTS AND LOTS OF MONEY.

434
00:20:59,300 --> 00:21:01,934
RuPaul: JIM BAKKER
REACHED OUT TO HIS FOLLOWERS

435
00:21:01,968 --> 00:21:03,067
TO PAY FOR HIS DREAM CITY

436
00:21:03,100 --> 00:21:05,567
WITH AN ENDLESS ROUND
OF TELETHONS.

437
00:21:05,601 --> 00:21:12,601
♪ PRAISE THE LORD ♪

438
00:21:13,567 --> 00:21:15,167
ENOUGH IS ENOUGH...

439
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:17,167
RuPaul: BUT ENOUGH
WAS NEVER ENOUGH.

440
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:19,734
AND I KNOW SOME
OF YOU HAVE GOTTEN
BUSY SIGNALS,

441
00:21:19,767 --> 00:21:22,300
SO START DIALING
RIGHT NOW, AND YOU
CAN GET THROUGH.

442
00:21:22,334 --> 00:21:24,400
RENEW YOUR PLEDGE,
MAKE YOUR PLEDGE.

443
00:21:24,434 --> 00:21:26,801
WE APOLOGIZE FOR
THE BUSY SIGNALS.

444
00:21:26,834 --> 00:21:28,300
NOW PARTNERS
ARE SAYING, "JIM,

445
00:21:28,334 --> 00:21:30,100
WE WANT JIM AND TAMMY
IN OUR HOMES."

446
00:21:30,133 --> 00:21:35,200
Tammy: I BEGAN
TO FEEL LIKE PTL
HAD GROWN SO FAR PAST ME,

447
00:21:35,234 --> 00:21:38,734
AND I DIDN'T FEEL LIKE
I WAS EVEN SOPHISTICATED ENOUGH

448
00:21:38,767 --> 00:21:41,047
TO BE IN SUCH
A HIGH POSITION.

449
00:21:41,067 --> 00:21:43,133
WE BEGAN TO LEAD
SEPARATE LIVES.

450
00:21:43,167 --> 00:21:46,834
JIM WAS SO BUSY RAISING MONEY
TO BUILD BUILDINGS,

451
00:21:46,868 --> 00:21:49,047
AND HE FORGOT HIS FAMILY.

452
00:21:49,067 --> 00:21:50,634
AND, UM...

453
00:21:50,667 --> 00:21:55,067
WE WERE LEFT
IN THE DUST SOMEWHERE.

454
00:22:00,067 --> 00:22:03,734
♪ THIS IS YOUR HERITAGE ♪

455
00:22:03,767 --> 00:22:05,400
♪ HERITAGE U.S.A. ♪

456
00:22:05,434 --> 00:22:06,868
RuPaul:
BY THE MID-EIGHTIES,

457
00:22:06,901 --> 00:22:08,167
HERITAGE PARK
WAS ON ITS WAY

458
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:12,234
TO BECOMING THE THIRD MOST
POPULAR RESORT DESTINATION
IN THE U.S.,

459
00:22:12,267 --> 00:22:16,047
BUT THE PRICE OF PTL's
SUCCESS KEPT CLIMBING.

460
00:22:16,067 --> 00:22:20,334
TODAY, WE ARE
AROUND $2 MILLION
IN PAST-DUE BILLS

461
00:22:20,367 --> 00:22:23,501
THAT MUST BE PAID
IF WE'RE GOING TO SAVE
THE ENTIRE NETWORK.

462
00:22:23,534 --> 00:22:25,834
SOON, I FIND MYSELF
WITH A BUDGET

463
00:22:25,868 --> 00:22:28,434
OF A MILLION DOLLARS
EVERY 2 DAYS.

464
00:22:28,467 --> 00:22:31,667
AND THE TAIL BEGAN
TO WAG THE DOG.

465
00:22:31,701 --> 00:22:34,467
YOU KNOW, REALLY,
IF EVERYONE WOULD DOUBLE
THEIR PLEDGE ONE MONTH...

466
00:22:34,501 --> 00:22:38,501
IF EVERY PERSON THAT
WATCHED THIS TELECAST
COULD GIVE $10 A MONTH...

467
00:22:38,534 --> 00:22:41,234
IF YOU HAVEN'T PLEDGED
THAT $15 A MONTH...

468
00:22:41,267 --> 00:22:43,667
CALL RIGHT NOW.
I WANT TO SEND YOU...

469
00:22:43,701 --> 00:22:46,968
THIS BEAUTIFUL LITTLE
RICE-PADDY BABY

470
00:22:47,067 --> 00:22:48,734
FOR YOUR GIFT OF $100.

471
00:22:48,767 --> 00:22:50,934
RuPaul: PTL's
CRISIS RIDDEN FINANCES

472
00:22:50,968 --> 00:22:54,934
ATTRACTED THE ATTENTION
OF A YOUNG REPORTER
AT THE LOCAL PAPER,

473
00:22:54,968 --> 00:22:56,534
THE CHARLOTTE OBSERVER.

474
00:22:56,567 --> 00:22:59,434
I HAD BEEN REPORTING ON PTL
FOR SEVERAL YEARS.

475
00:22:59,467 --> 00:23:02,167
AND THERE WAS A HISTORY
OF MISMANAGEMENT,

476
00:23:02,200 --> 00:23:03,734
AND OF QUESTIONABLE
SPENDING OF MONEY.

477
00:23:03,767 --> 00:23:07,047
TAMMY AND I
ARE UNDERGOING
THE MOST VICIOUS ATTACKS

478
00:23:07,067 --> 00:23:09,834
IN THE HISTORY
OF THIS MINISTRY.

479
00:23:09,868 --> 00:23:11,300
BY NOW, PERHAPS,
YOU THINK

480
00:23:11,334 --> 00:23:13,567
THAT WE SHOULD BE
USED TO THESE ATTACKS.

481
00:23:13,601 --> 00:23:15,968
BUT IT'S BEEN GOING ON
FOR A LONG TIME, TAMMY.

482
00:23:16,067 --> 00:23:18,047
YES, JIM.
IT'S BEEN GOING ON
FOR ALMOST 10 YEARS.

483
00:23:18,067 --> 00:23:20,133
USA TODAY CARRIED
THIS BLURB:

484
00:23:20,167 --> 00:23:21,400
"PTL PRESIDENT JIM BAKKER

485
00:23:21,434 --> 00:23:23,267
USED DONATIONS
TO HIS TELEVISION MINISTRY

486
00:23:23,300 --> 00:23:25,334
TO BUY PERSONAL ITEMS,
LIKE A MINK COAT,

487
00:23:25,367 --> 00:23:26,801
A SPORTS CAR,
AND A HOUSE BOAT,

488
00:23:26,834 --> 00:23:29,267
THE CHARLOTTE OBSERVER
REPORTED SUNDAY."

489
00:23:29,300 --> 00:23:32,133
I HAVE ALL
THE CANCELLED CHECKS.

490
00:23:32,167 --> 00:23:33,133
I'LL HAVE TO PICK 'EM
ALL BACK UP AGAIN.

491
00:23:33,167 --> 00:23:37,567
I THINK THE FACT IS BAKKER
LATCHED ONTO AN IDEA

492
00:23:37,601 --> 00:23:41,067
THAT WAS GONNA HELP
PROPEL HIS MINISTRY FORWARD,

493
00:23:41,100 --> 00:23:43,767
AND IT THEN BECAME
A VERY CONVENIENT WAY

494
00:23:43,801 --> 00:23:45,601
TO DO A LOT
OF OTHER THINGS,

495
00:23:45,634 --> 00:23:47,067
AND HE MADE
SOME STATEMENTS

496
00:23:47,100 --> 00:23:49,067
ABOUT WHAT HE WAS
GONNA DO WITH THIS MONEY,

497
00:23:49,100 --> 00:23:50,434
THAT HE THEN
DID NOT FOLLOW.

498
00:23:50,467 --> 00:23:52,467
Announcer: HERE ARE
JIM AND TAMMY BAKKER!

499
00:23:52,501 --> 00:23:55,167
RuPaul: DESPITE THE ATTACKS,
THE BAKKERS CONTINUED TO SHINE

500
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:58,200
AS CHRISTIAN TELEVISION'S
BRIGHTEST STARS.

501
00:23:58,234 --> 00:23:59,200
BY SPECIAL REQUEST,

502
00:23:59,234 --> 00:24:02,567
HERE'S TAMMY FAYE
TO SING WE'RE BLESSED!

503
00:24:02,601 --> 00:24:05,834
♪ WE'RE BLESSED,
WE'RE BLESSED,
WE'RE BLESSED ♪

504
00:24:05,868 --> 00:24:07,400
♪ WE ARE BLESSED ♪

505
00:24:07,434 --> 00:24:10,267
♪ OH, WE GIVE SHELTER,
CLOTHING, AND STRENGTH ♪

506
00:24:10,300 --> 00:24:12,167
♪ WE ARE BLESSED ♪

507
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:14,767
♪ WE'RE BLESSED,
WE'RE BLESSED,
WE'RE BLESSED ♪

508
00:24:14,801 --> 00:24:19,267
OFF SCREEN, THEIR MARRIAGE
WAS FALLING APART.

509
00:24:19,300 --> 00:24:21,047
JIM HAD A SECRET.

510
00:24:21,067 --> 00:24:25,067
JIM BAKKER,
MEET JESSICA HAHN.

511
00:24:28,067 --> 00:24:30,901
Charles: IN 1980, ONE OF HIS
RELIGIOUS ASSOCIATES

512
00:24:30,934 --> 00:24:33,467
HAD ARRANGED
AN ENCOUNTER IN A HOTEL ROOM

513
00:24:33,501 --> 00:24:34,567
WITH A WOMAN
NAMED JESSICA HAHN,

514
00:24:34,601 --> 00:24:36,167
A YOUNG WOMAN,
I THINK, IN HER EARLY 20s.

515
00:24:36,200 --> 00:24:40,767
AND THAT LED TO
A SEXUAL ENCOUNTER
OF SOME KIND OR ANOTHER.

516
00:24:40,801 --> 00:24:45,100
THERE'S A DISPUTE
OVER WHAT EXACTLY
HAPPENED IN THAT ROOM.

517
00:24:46,901 --> 00:24:49,767
THAT DAY ALL MY DREAMS
WERE SHATTERED

518
00:24:49,801 --> 00:24:53,834
AND MY LIFE WOULD NEVER
BE THE SAME.

519
00:25:03,267 --> 00:25:06,167
Charles: IN EARLY 1985...

520
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:08,601
PTL AGREED TO SETTLE

521
00:25:08,634 --> 00:25:11,300
A THREATENED LAWSUIT
BY JESSICA HAHN

522
00:25:11,334 --> 00:25:12,501
BY PAYING HER
A SUM OF MONEY.

523
00:25:12,534 --> 00:25:15,868
RuPaul: ONCE AGAIN,
THE PTL NETWORK
TURNED TO ROE MESSNER,

524
00:25:15,901 --> 00:25:18,834
APPARENTLY WITHOUT
JIM'S KNOWLEDGE.

525
00:25:18,868 --> 00:25:22,400
Roe: THEY CAME TO ME AND
SAID WE GOT A PROBLEM.

526
00:25:22,434 --> 00:25:25,767
WE'VE MADE AN AGREEMENT
WITH THIS LADY

527
00:25:25,801 --> 00:25:30,534
THAT IF WE
PAY HER $265,000,

528
00:25:30,567 --> 00:25:32,501
SHE'LL GO AWAY.

529
00:25:32,534 --> 00:25:36,400
AND I SAID THAT'S
NOT THE WAY TO DO THAT.

530
00:25:36,434 --> 00:25:37,701
I SAID YOU
SHOULDN'T DO THAT.

531
00:25:37,734 --> 00:25:39,767
I SAID, "I'LL LOAN
YOU THE MONEY,

532
00:25:39,801 --> 00:25:41,167
BUT," I SAYS,
"IT'S A LOAN.

533
00:25:41,200 --> 00:25:42,667
I WANT THE MONEY
PAID BACK."

534
00:25:42,701 --> 00:25:45,634
RuPaul: UNAWARE
OF JIM'S SECRET,

535
00:25:45,667 --> 00:25:48,734
TAMMY FAYE WAS STRUGGLING
WITH HER OWN.

536
00:25:48,767 --> 00:25:50,667
JOIN THE PTL CLUB,

537
00:25:50,701 --> 00:25:53,968
AND TAMMY WANTS TO
SEND YOU A COPY OF HER BOOK

538
00:25:54,067 --> 00:25:56,834
HOW TO OVERCOME FEAR.

539
00:25:56,868 --> 00:25:58,634
Tammy: I BECAME
VERY NERVOUS,

540
00:25:58,667 --> 00:25:59,634
SO I WENT
TO THE DOCTOR

541
00:25:59,667 --> 00:26:00,767
WITH A
HYPERVENTILATION
PROBLEM,

542
00:26:00,801 --> 00:26:05,667
AND THEY KNEW
IT WAS A CASE OF
NERVOUS FRUSTRATION.

543
00:26:05,701 --> 00:26:09,567
AND SO THEY
GAVE ME A LITTLE
PILL CALLED ADAVAN.

544
00:26:09,601 --> 00:26:11,868
AND ADAVAN...

545
00:26:11,901 --> 00:26:15,067
WAS A WONDERFUL DRUG
FOR ME AT THE TIME.

546
00:26:15,100 --> 00:26:16,834
I DIDN'T TAKE
MY MEDICINE TODAY

547
00:26:16,868 --> 00:26:18,100
BECAUSE I WANTED
TO BE BRIGHT.

548
00:26:18,133 --> 00:26:19,968
YESTERDAY,
I ALMOST FELL OFF
MY HIGH HEELS.

549
00:26:20,067 --> 00:26:23,100
I WAS ON MEDICINE,
TAKING MY MEDICINE,
SO I'M NOT SAYING--

550
00:26:23,133 --> 00:26:26,601
THIS WAS HER WAY OF
DEALING WITH THE STRESS

551
00:26:26,634 --> 00:26:30,234
THAT SHE WAS UNDER
IN THE RELATIONSHIP.

552
00:26:30,267 --> 00:26:32,234
AND SHE WOULD
LITERALLY LOSE TRACK

553
00:26:32,267 --> 00:26:35,047
OF THE NUMBER OF ADAVAN
THAT SHE WOULD TAKE.

554
00:26:35,067 --> 00:26:38,167
TAMMY, I THINK YOU OUGHT
TO SING A SONG FOR US.

555
00:26:38,200 --> 00:26:39,968
I'M BACK HERE LOOKING
AT THE BOAT, JIM.

556
00:26:40,067 --> 00:26:41,367
ISN'T THIS
A MAGNIFICENT THING?

557
00:26:41,400 --> 00:26:42,367
YES.

558
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:43,934
RIGHT HERE
ON OUR BEACH.

559
00:26:43,968 --> 00:26:45,801
IT LOOKS BRAND NEW.
I BET--

560
00:26:45,834 --> 00:26:48,334
I'M GONNA TAKE
MY SHOES OFF AND
WADE IN THE WATER.

561
00:26:48,367 --> 00:26:51,767
I DON'T THINK THAT
BOAT'S EVER SEEN WATER.

562
00:26:51,801 --> 00:26:52,934
[GIGGLING]

563
00:26:52,968 --> 00:26:54,047
I FINALLY GOT
TO THE POINT

564
00:26:54,067 --> 00:26:57,534
WHERE I HAD
TO HAVE ADAVAN
WITH ME AT ALL TIMES.

565
00:26:57,567 --> 00:27:00,601
RuPaul:
THEN TAMMY OVERDOSED.

566
00:27:00,634 --> 00:27:02,047
Tammy: WE HAD JUST
BROKEN GROUND

567
00:27:02,067 --> 00:27:04,567
FOR ONE OF THE BUILDINGS
THAT WE WERE GETTING
READY TO BUILD.

568
00:27:04,601 --> 00:27:07,667
IT WAS GOING TO BE
A FOOTBALL FIELD LONG.

569
00:27:07,701 --> 00:27:09,100
AND WE HAD
BROKEN GROUND.

570
00:27:09,133 --> 00:27:11,067
THE DAY WAS
VERY, VERY COLD,

571
00:27:11,100 --> 00:27:13,534
AND NONE OF US HAD
WORN PROPER CLOTHING.

572
00:27:13,567 --> 00:27:17,367
AND I GOT PNEUMONIA
AS A RESULT OF THAT.

573
00:27:17,400 --> 00:27:20,434
THEY SAID THAT I HAD
ENOUGH ADAVAN IN ME

574
00:27:20,467 --> 00:27:23,047
THAT WOULD'VE KILLED
A HUGE TRUCK DRIVER.

575
00:27:23,067 --> 00:27:25,767
RuPaul: TAMMY WAS RUSHED
ON A FRIEND'S PRIVATE JET

576
00:27:25,801 --> 00:27:30,267
TO EISENHOWER MEDICAL CENTER
IN PALM SPRINGS, CALIFORNIA.

577
00:27:30,300 --> 00:27:33,968
ON THE AIRPLANE I WENT
INTO HALLUCINATIONS.

578
00:27:35,534 --> 00:27:36,701
IT-IT'S PLEASANT.

579
00:27:36,734 --> 00:27:39,567
IT IS PLEASANT
WHEN YOU'RE IN A
DRUG-INDUCED STATE OF MIND.

580
00:27:39,601 --> 00:27:43,634
I MEAN, YOU CAN SIT
AND WATCH WONDERFUL THINGS,

581
00:27:43,667 --> 00:27:46,100
AND I SAW CARTOONS.

582
00:27:46,133 --> 00:27:47,234
BUT THEN
THERE ARE TIMES

583
00:27:47,267 --> 00:27:50,334
WHEN YOU SEE REALLY
HORRIBLE THINGS, TOO.

584
00:27:51,434 --> 00:27:54,300
I SAW THESE MEN WITH
THESE BLACK CAPES ON.

585
00:27:54,334 --> 00:27:56,901
I SAW THEM COMING
AT ME IN DROVES.

586
00:27:56,934 --> 00:27:58,334
RuPaul: ONCE ON THE PLANE,

587
00:27:58,367 --> 00:28:03,334
TAMMY TRIED TO DISEMBARK
AT 30,000 FEET.

588
00:28:06,534 --> 00:28:08,067
Tammy: THEY TOOK ME
FROM THE HOSPITAL

589
00:28:08,100 --> 00:28:10,334
DIRECTLY TO
THE BETTY FORD CENTER.

590
00:28:10,367 --> 00:28:12,868
I THOUGHT I WAS BEING
PUNISHED FOR SOMETHING,

591
00:28:12,901 --> 00:28:17,267
AND I DIDN'T KNOW WHAT
I WAS BEING PUNISHED FOR.

592
00:28:35,067 --> 00:28:37,868
IT STILL HURTS ME...

593
00:28:37,901 --> 00:28:42,834
THAT THEY DID NOT
TELL ME THEY WERE
GONNA DO THAT TO ME.

594
00:28:42,868 --> 00:28:46,968
SHE SPENT ONE NIGHT
THERE AND THEN LEFT.

595
00:28:47,067 --> 00:28:49,300
ALL I NEEDED
WAS TO BE EDUCATED,

596
00:28:49,334 --> 00:28:52,167
BECAUSE I'M
AN INTELLIGENT PERSON,
AND THAT'S ALL I NEEDED.

597
00:28:52,200 --> 00:28:55,400
ONCE I WAS EDUCATED
AND REALIZED WHAT I WAS DOING,

598
00:28:55,434 --> 00:28:58,734
I STOPPED IT
AND I HAVE NEVER, EVER

599
00:28:58,767 --> 00:29:03,234
HAVE HAD TO--HAVE--HAVE,
UH...BEEN ADDICTED
TO ANYTHING AGAIN.

600
00:29:05,267 --> 00:29:07,047
JUST DIET COKE.

601
00:29:07,067 --> 00:29:09,701
BUT THE PRESIDENT
LIKES IT, TOO,

602
00:29:09,734 --> 00:29:12,667
SO I'M
IN GOOD COMPANY.

603
00:29:15,868 --> 00:29:17,434
[BLEEP]

604
00:29:18,133 --> 00:29:19,868
Both: HEE HEE HEE HEE.

605
00:29:19,901 --> 00:29:21,467
I WENT AWAY
FOR A WHILE,

606
00:29:21,501 --> 00:29:26,267
AND I HAVE LEARNED
THE BEST LESSON
IN MY WHOLE LIFE.

607
00:29:26,300 --> 00:29:29,567
I LEARNED HOW MUCH
I LOVED MY HUSBAND,

608
00:29:29,601 --> 00:29:31,801
HOW MUCH I CARED
FOR MY HUSBAND.

609
00:29:31,834 --> 00:29:34,367
AND I LEARNED
A LESSON OF LONELINESS

610
00:29:34,400 --> 00:29:36,567
SUCH AS I'VE NEVER
FELT IN MY LIFE.

611
00:29:36,601 --> 00:29:38,334
WHEN I HAD TO
GO OUT ALL OF A SUDDEN

612
00:29:38,367 --> 00:29:40,667
AND GO BY MYSELF
AND DO MY WASHING

613
00:29:40,701 --> 00:29:42,601
TO A PLACE WHERE
I DIDN'T EVEN--

614
00:29:42,634 --> 00:29:43,601
WAS NOT FAMILIAR WITH,

615
00:29:43,634 --> 00:29:46,000
WHEN I HAD TO CARRY OUT MY
OWN GARBAGE,

616
00:29:46,033 --> 00:29:48,567
WHEN I HAD TO DO
ALL THE THINGS

617
00:29:48,601 --> 00:29:50,467
THAT I DID WITH
SOMEONE I LOVED BEFORE,

618
00:29:50,501 --> 00:29:52,567
WHEN I HAD TO
DO IT ALL BY MYSELF,

619
00:29:52,601 --> 00:29:54,100
ALL OF A SUDDEN,
I REALIZED

620
00:29:54,133 --> 00:29:58,501
THAT THERE WAS
A LOT MORE TO MARRIAGE
THAN JUST THE SPARKLES.

621
00:29:58,534 --> 00:30:03,100
RuPaul: JIM AND TAMMY
DECIDED TO STAY IN THEIR
HOME IN PALM SPRINGS

622
00:30:03,133 --> 00:30:04,968
AND PUT THEIR MARRIAGE
BACK TOGETHER,

623
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:08,701
BUT THINGS
TURNED OUT DIFFERENTLY.

624
00:30:09,667 --> 00:30:11,634
THE THING I REMEMBER
MOST ABOUT THIS HOUSE,

625
00:30:11,667 --> 00:30:13,868
I BELIEVE,
IS THE WIND.

626
00:30:13,901 --> 00:30:16,601
WE USED TO GO UP
ON TOP OF THE ROOF
OF THE GARAGE

627
00:30:16,634 --> 00:30:20,701
AND LISTEN TO
THE WIND BLOWING THROUGH
THE PALM TREES AT NIGHT.

628
00:30:20,734 --> 00:30:25,400
AND THE MOON WOULD BE OUT.
IT WOULD BE SO BEAUTIFUL
HERE IN THE DESERT.

629
00:30:25,434 --> 00:30:27,934
THIS IS THE HOUSE
WHERE OUR WHOLE LIVES

630
00:30:27,968 --> 00:30:30,267
CAME TUMBLING DOWN ON US.

631
00:30:31,734 --> 00:30:34,200
I WAS STILL VERY WEAK
AND VERY SICK

632
00:30:34,234 --> 00:30:37,234
WHEN I FINISHED
THE BETTY FORD PROGRAM.

633
00:30:37,267 --> 00:30:39,200
AND JIM WAS
REALLY BURNED OUT,

634
00:30:39,234 --> 00:30:40,901
HAVING TO RAISE
$1 MILLION A WEEK

635
00:30:40,934 --> 00:30:43,901
TO KEEP PTL ON THE AIR,
AND TO KEEP ALL
THE BILLS PAID.

636
00:30:43,934 --> 00:30:46,701
Jim: IT WAS BEGINNING
TO CRUSH ME.

637
00:30:46,734 --> 00:30:48,601
AT THE END OF THE DAY,

638
00:30:48,634 --> 00:30:51,868
I WOULD LITERALLY
HAVE TO THINK TO WALK.

639
00:30:51,901 --> 00:30:54,868
I DON'T KNOW IF YOU
CAN UNDERSTAND THAT,
BUT I'D HAVE TO--

640
00:30:54,901 --> 00:30:58,300
I WAS SO EXHAUSTED,
I'D HAVE TO, YOU KNOW--

641
00:30:58,334 --> 00:31:00,300
USUALLY YOUR BODY WILL
JUST WALK BY ITSELF,

642
00:31:00,334 --> 00:31:04,267
BUT I'M HAVING
TO PICK UP MY FEET
ON PURPOSE TO WALK.

643
00:31:04,300 --> 00:31:09,467
AND SO JERRY FALWELL
KNEW JUST WHEN TO HIT.

644
00:31:10,367 --> 00:31:14,334
RuPaul: ALTHOUGH JIM AND
TAMMY WERE THE MOST POPULAR
EVANGELISTS OF THEIR TIME,

645
00:31:14,367 --> 00:31:18,667
SOUTHERN BAPTIST MINISTER
JERRY FALWELL WAS
THE MOST POWERFUL.

646
00:31:18,701 --> 00:31:21,133
HE WAS THE FOUNDER
OF THE MORAL MAJORITY

647
00:31:21,167 --> 00:31:24,300
AND PLAYED A KEY ROLE
IN REAGAN'S ELECTION.

648
00:31:24,334 --> 00:31:26,534
HE PREACHED A RETURN
TO FAMILY VALUES

649
00:31:26,567 --> 00:31:32,234
AND SINGLED OUT
THE PRO-ABORTION AND
GAY MOVEMENTS FOR ATTACK.

650
00:31:32,434 --> 00:31:36,934
FALWELL'S EMPIRE
INCLUDED A SUCCESSFUL
TELEVISION MINISTRY

651
00:31:36,968 --> 00:31:38,367
AND A UNIVERSITY,

652
00:31:38,400 --> 00:31:42,334
BUT IT DID NOT
INCLUDE A SATELLITE.

653
00:31:42,901 --> 00:31:45,200
HE CALLS JIM UP
AND HE SAYS,

654
00:31:45,234 --> 00:31:49,300
"JIM, I HAVE FOUND
SOMETHING OUT THAT
I AM GOING TO--

655
00:31:49,334 --> 00:31:52,901
"THAT IS GOING TO BE
LEAKED TO THE NEWSPAPERS

656
00:31:52,934 --> 00:31:56,300
"IF YOU DON'T
ALLOW ME TO HELP YOU."

657
00:31:56,334 --> 00:31:58,167
HE SAYS, "LET ME FLY OUT
TO CALIFORNIA,

658
00:31:58,200 --> 00:32:00,901
AND I WANT TO HELP YOU
AND TAMMY THROUGH THIS."

659
00:32:00,934 --> 00:32:04,701
AND THEN HE BROUGHT UP
THE NAME JESSICA HAHN.

660
00:32:09,200 --> 00:32:11,047
THIS IS WHERE
I HEARD JIM TELL ME

661
00:32:11,067 --> 00:32:13,968
THAT HE HAD HAD
A ONE-NIGHT STAND

662
00:32:14,067 --> 00:32:16,701
WITH A YOUNG LADY
BY THE NAME OF JESSICA HAHN.

663
00:32:16,734 --> 00:32:19,534
EVEN THOUGH IT HAD
HAPPENED 9 YEARS BEFORE,

664
00:32:19,567 --> 00:32:23,601
TO ME, IT WAS LIKE
IT HAD HAPPENED YESTERDAY.

665
00:32:23,634 --> 00:32:26,667
I LAID ON THE FLOOR
AND I CRIED FOR 3 DAYS.

666
00:32:26,701 --> 00:32:30,167
I COULDN'T BELIEVE WHAT
HAD HAPPENED TO MY LIFE.

667
00:32:30,200 --> 00:32:34,367
AND I DIDN'T KNOW
HOW TO SOLVE IT.

668
00:32:35,400 --> 00:32:37,167
RuPaul: TAMMY WROTE
TO JESSICA HAHN,

669
00:32:37,200 --> 00:32:41,400
ASKING TO MEET WITH HER.
SHE DECLINED.

670
00:32:41,434 --> 00:32:44,300
SHE DID, HOWEVER,
TELL HER SIDE OF THE STORY

671
00:32:44,334 --> 00:32:47,467
IN A 1993 PLAYBOY VIDEO.

672
00:32:47,501 --> 00:32:49,200
I WOULD REALLY
LIKE PEOPLE TO KNOW

673
00:32:49,234 --> 00:32:52,834
THERE ARE SIDES
OF MY PERSONALITY
THAT NO ONE HAS SEEN.

674
00:32:52,868 --> 00:32:57,501
I WOULD JUST LIKE PEOPLE
TO KNOW THE REAL ME.

675
00:33:04,801 --> 00:33:06,834
Tammy: JERRY FALWELL
FLEW HIS PRIVATE JET OUT.

676
00:33:06,868 --> 00:33:09,467
HE SAID--HE PUT
HIS ARMS AROUND ME--
"I WANT TO HELP YOU."

677
00:33:09,501 --> 00:33:13,334
AND WITH THAT, HE SAID,
"IF YOU WILL GIVE PTL
TO ME FOR 6 WEEKS,"

678
00:33:13,367 --> 00:33:17,701
HE SAID, "WHILE
THIS STORY BREAKS,
WHICH IS BOUND TO BREAK,"

679
00:33:17,734 --> 00:33:20,834
HE SAID,
"WE WILL BE THE CATALYST,

680
00:33:20,868 --> 00:33:24,047
"AND IN 6 WEEKS,
YOU WILL HAVE
YOUR MINISTRY BACK,

681
00:33:24,067 --> 00:33:25,934
AND IT WILL BE LIKE
NOTHING EVER HAPPENED."

682
00:33:25,968 --> 00:33:30,067
AN ATTACK ON
ONE DENOMINATION
IS AN ATTACK ON ALL.

683
00:33:30,100 --> 00:33:32,601
WE MUST SHARE
THE BREAD OF ADVERSITY

684
00:33:32,634 --> 00:33:33,601
AND THE WATER
OF AFFLICTION.

685
00:33:33,634 --> 00:33:35,801
JIM SWALLOWED IT
HOOK, LINE, AND SINKER.

686
00:33:35,834 --> 00:33:40,934
BUT I KNEW THERE WAS
SOMETHING WRONG SOMEWHERE,

687
00:33:40,968 --> 00:33:43,234
AND I BEGGED HIM--
I BEGGED HIM

688
00:33:43,267 --> 00:33:46,200
NOT TO GIVE UP HIS PLACE
ON THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS.

689
00:33:46,234 --> 00:33:49,701
I TOLD HIM,
"GO BACK AND TALK TO
THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS.

690
00:33:49,734 --> 00:33:51,567
"GO BACK AND
TALK TO YOUR PEOPLE

691
00:33:51,601 --> 00:33:53,734
BEFORE YOU DO
SOMETHING LIKE THIS."

692
00:33:53,767 --> 00:33:55,133
AND JIM SAID, "NO.

693
00:33:55,167 --> 00:33:56,133
"DADDY FALWELL'S HERE.

694
00:33:56,167 --> 00:33:59,534
HE'LL TAKE CARE
OF EVERYTHING."

695
00:34:04,767 --> 00:34:08,300
BY EARLY 1987,
I HAD COLLECTED
THE INFORMATION

696
00:34:08,334 --> 00:34:13,734
I NEEDED TO PUBLISH
A STORY ABOUT JESSICA HAHN
AND ABOUT THAT PAYOFF.

697
00:34:14,434 --> 00:34:16,367
ON MARCH 19, 1987,

698
00:34:16,400 --> 00:34:19,047
IN AN INTERVIEW
WITH US ABOUT THE STORY,

699
00:34:19,067 --> 00:34:22,767
INSTEAD OF AN INTERVIEW,
WE HEARD A RESIGNATION
SPEECH OVER THE TELEPHONE.

700
00:34:22,801 --> 00:34:26,367
JIM WAS IN CALIFORNIA.
HE READ THIS RESIGNATION.

701
00:34:26,400 --> 00:34:28,567
HE GOT OFF THE PHONE
AND IMMEDIATELY

702
00:34:28,601 --> 00:34:30,267
A MAN NAMED
JERRY FALWELL COMES ON,

703
00:34:30,300 --> 00:34:32,534
WHICH IS A SHOCK TO ALL
OF US AT THE NEWSPAPER.

704
00:34:32,567 --> 00:34:37,834
AND FALWELL HAS
BEEN GIVEN BY JIM
THE MANTLE OF RUNNING PTL.

705
00:34:37,868 --> 00:34:39,901
HOW CAN WE SAY THANK YOU
FOR YOU GENTLEMEN

706
00:34:39,934 --> 00:34:44,200
WHO HAVE STOOD
BY JIM AND TAMMY'S SIDE,
AND ALL OF OUR SIDE?

707
00:34:44,234 --> 00:34:46,067
IF OUR ARMS
WERE BIG ENOUGH,

708
00:34:46,100 --> 00:34:48,667
WE'D JUST WRAP THEM
ALL AROUND ALL OF YOU.

709
00:34:48,701 --> 00:34:49,734
WE REALLY WOULD.

710
00:34:49,767 --> 00:34:50,801
Charles: THAT STORY
EXPLODED.

711
00:34:50,834 --> 00:34:54,200
IT WAS THE STORY
FOR NEWSPAPERS

712
00:34:54,234 --> 00:34:57,133
AND TELEVISION
AROUND THE COUNTRY.

713
00:34:59,534 --> 00:35:01,100
ARE YOU PLANNING
ON COMING BACK?

714
00:35:01,133 --> 00:35:02,400
I REMEMBER
GOING TO PTL

715
00:35:02,434 --> 00:35:03,801
AND GOING INTO
THIS NEWS CONFERENCE

716
00:35:03,834 --> 00:35:05,901
THAT FALWELL HELD
AT THE HOTEL,

717
00:35:05,934 --> 00:35:08,634
AND I HAVE TO SAY,
FEELING SOME BLUSH OF PRIDE

718
00:35:08,667 --> 00:35:12,734
AT WHAT MY GOOD REPORTING
HAD CREATED HERE.

719
00:35:12,767 --> 00:35:14,234
Tammy: O.J. SIMPSON
WAS NOTHING

720
00:35:14,267 --> 00:35:16,434
COMPARED TO WHAT
WE HAD AROUND US.

721
00:35:16,467 --> 00:35:17,634
IT WAS UNBELIEVABLE.

722
00:35:17,667 --> 00:35:19,467
WE JUST WANTED
TO SAY HELLO,

723
00:35:19,501 --> 00:35:20,767
AND THANK ALL
YOU CAMERAMEN

724
00:35:20,801 --> 00:35:22,200
AND ALL YOU
PRESS PEOPLE.

725
00:35:22,234 --> 00:35:24,200
I HATE IT
YOU HAD TO STAND OUT

726
00:35:24,234 --> 00:35:25,968
IN THIS HOT SUN
IN THIS DESERT.

727
00:35:26,067 --> 00:35:29,400
THEY WERE 4,
5 DEEP FOR THE WHOLE BLOCK,

728
00:35:29,434 --> 00:35:30,667
DOWN ALL AROUND OUR HOUSE.

729
00:35:30,701 --> 00:35:34,047
THERE WAS NO PLACE
FOR US TO HIDE AT ALL.

730
00:35:34,067 --> 00:35:37,067
REMEMBER, I WAS
11 YEARS OLD WHEN
THIS WAS HAPPENING,

731
00:35:37,100 --> 00:35:39,567
BUT I COULD TELL
SOMETHING WAS GOING WRONG.

732
00:35:39,601 --> 00:35:43,734
SHARE WITH US.
HOW'S JAMIE CHARLES
AND TAMMY SUE DOING?

733
00:35:43,767 --> 00:35:44,734
WE'RE CONCERNED.

734
00:35:44,767 --> 00:35:47,133
I WISH YOU'D
STARTED SOMEWHERE ELSE.

735
00:35:47,167 --> 00:35:48,734
[CRYING]

736
00:35:49,167 --> 00:35:51,634
ONE OF THE LAST THING
JAMIE CHARLES SAID IS,

737
00:35:51,667 --> 00:35:55,167
"WILL I GET A CHANCE
TO GO HOME AND GET MY TOYS?"

738
00:35:55,200 --> 00:35:56,968
Man: AW, BLESS HIM.

739
00:35:57,601 --> 00:35:58,934
AND SUSIE'S DOING WELL.

740
00:35:58,968 --> 00:36:02,067
I RAN AWAY
FROM HOME.

741
00:36:03,868 --> 00:36:05,567
WHAT WOULD
ANY TEENAGER DO?

742
00:36:05,601 --> 00:36:07,834
RUN AWAY.
THAT'S THE ANSWER.

743
00:36:07,868 --> 00:36:10,868
YOU KNOW.
AND THAT'S WHAT I DID.

744
00:36:11,901 --> 00:36:13,834
RuPaul: ON JUNE 11, 1987,

745
00:36:13,868 --> 00:36:15,067
JIM AND TAMMY
WENT ON THE AIR

746
00:36:15,100 --> 00:36:19,467
TO ADDRESS THE PTL AUDIENCE
FOR WHAT WOULD BE
THE LAST TIME.

747
00:36:19,501 --> 00:36:21,334
TAMMY AND I ARE
SO VERY GLAD

748
00:36:21,367 --> 00:36:23,934
THAT WE'VE
BEEN GRANTED
THIS OPPORTUNITY

749
00:36:23,968 --> 00:36:27,047
TO TALK
WITH YOU TODAY.

750
00:36:27,067 --> 00:36:29,047
AND SAY HELLO.

751
00:36:29,067 --> 00:36:32,133
YES. HELLO, EVERYONE.

752
00:36:32,167 --> 00:36:35,133
AND WE WANT
TO SAY TO YOU

753
00:36:35,167 --> 00:36:38,667
THAT WE ARE SO
VERY, VERY SORRY.

754
00:36:38,701 --> 00:36:40,901
I BELIEVE, TAMMY,

755
00:36:40,934 --> 00:36:43,267
'CAUSE THE GOD I
SERVE IS STILL GOD,

756
00:36:43,300 --> 00:36:46,334
I BELIEVE THE SUN
WILL SHINE AGAIN.

757
00:36:46,367 --> 00:36:47,334
OH, I DO, TOO, JIM.

758
00:36:47,367 --> 00:36:48,334
YOU WANT TO SING IT?

759
00:36:48,367 --> 00:36:49,400
I'LL DO IT.
CAN YOU DO IT?

760
00:36:49,434 --> 00:36:51,734
ALL RIGHT,
TAMMY FAYE IS GONNA
SING A SONG FOR YOU

761
00:36:51,767 --> 00:36:55,400
JUST BEFORE
WE LEAVE OUR HOUSE.

762
00:36:55,701 --> 00:36:58,367
MAYBE YOU'RE HURTING
AND YOU NEED THIS
SONG TODAY, TOO,

763
00:36:58,400 --> 00:37:01,234
SO, I'LL SING IT
FOR BOTH OF US, OK?

764
00:37:01,267 --> 00:37:08,167
♪ OH, THE SUN
WILL SHINE AGAIN ♪

765
00:37:08,200 --> 00:37:14,534
♪ THE SUN
WILL SHINE AGAIN ♪

766
00:37:14,567 --> 00:37:21,167
♪ OH, THE SUN
WILL SHINE AGAIN ♪

767
00:37:21,200 --> 00:37:22,167
WE CAME IN HERE FIRST

768
00:37:22,200 --> 00:37:24,767
BECAUSE WE FELT
JIM BAKKER WANTED US HERE.

769
00:37:24,801 --> 00:37:28,601
♪ A NEW DAY
WILL BREAK ♪

770
00:37:28,634 --> 00:37:31,133
WE NOW FEEL
A HIGHER CALLING.

771
00:37:31,167 --> 00:37:33,534
WE FEEL THAT GOD
WANTS US HERE,

772
00:37:33,567 --> 00:37:34,801
AT LEAST FOR
THE TIME BEING.

773
00:37:34,834 --> 00:37:39,133
JERRY FALWELL CAME IN
TO RESCUE THE NETWORK,

774
00:37:39,167 --> 00:37:42,467
BUT, IN FACT, TOOK IT.

775
00:37:42,501 --> 00:37:45,601
RESCUE, TAKE,
THEY'RE OPPOSITES.

776
00:37:45,634 --> 00:37:48,434
I FEEL LIKE GOD HAS
FORGIVEN ME OF SO MUCH,

777
00:37:48,467 --> 00:37:53,067
THAT I WILL
FORGIVE EVERYONE
WHO HAS HURT US.

778
00:37:53,100 --> 00:37:54,667
AND SO WE JUST
WANT EVERYONE

779
00:37:54,701 --> 00:37:56,234
TO BEGIN TO
LOVE ONE ANOTHER,

780
00:37:56,267 --> 00:37:58,868
AND THAT THE CHURCH WORLD
WILL LOVE ONE ANOTHER,

781
00:37:58,901 --> 00:38:01,334
THAT THE PEOPLE OF GOD
WILL NOT FIGHT.

782
00:38:01,367 --> 00:38:04,367
OH, I BELIEVE YOUR
MIDNIGHT'S ALMOST OVER.

783
00:38:04,400 --> 00:38:09,467
AND THANK GOD,
THE SUN IS GOING
TO SHINE AGAIN.

784
00:38:09,501 --> 00:38:10,567
PRAISE THE LORD.

785
00:38:10,601 --> 00:38:11,567
[APPLAUSE]

786
00:38:11,601 --> 00:38:14,601
Man: HALLELUJAH!
PRAISE THE LORD!

787
00:38:21,100 --> 00:38:22,634
Roe: JERRY FALWELL
CALLED ME UP,

788
00:38:22,667 --> 00:38:24,901
AND HE SAID, "ROE,
I WANT YOU TO GO OUT

789
00:38:24,934 --> 00:38:27,234
AND SEE
JIM AND TAMMY FOR ME."

790
00:38:27,267 --> 00:38:28,667
HE SAID, "I WANT YOU
TO GO OUT THERE

791
00:38:28,701 --> 00:38:30,067
"AND TELL THEM
I'M GOING TO GIVE THEM

792
00:38:30,100 --> 00:38:31,567
"300,000 SALARY
THIS YEAR.

793
00:38:31,601 --> 00:38:34,634
"I'M GOING TO TAKE CARE OF
THEIR HEALTH INSURANCE,

794
00:38:34,667 --> 00:38:36,634
"PAY THE PHONE BILL,

795
00:38:36,667 --> 00:38:39,601
"I'M GOING TO GIVE THEM
ONE SECURITY GUARD,

796
00:38:39,634 --> 00:38:40,901
A MAID," HE SAID,

797
00:38:40,934 --> 00:38:43,434
AND YOU KNOW, JUST HAVE
THEM WRITE IT DOWN
ON A PIECE OF PAPER."

798
00:38:43,467 --> 00:38:47,047
ROE, THINKING
THAT FALWELL WAS
AN HONORABLE MAN,

799
00:38:47,067 --> 00:38:50,334
CAME OUT TO OUR
HOUSE AND TOLD US THIS.

800
00:38:50,367 --> 00:38:53,734
AND SO HE SAID,
"TAMMY, YOU NEED TO
JUST GET A PIECE OF PAPER

801
00:38:53,767 --> 00:38:55,767
"AND YOU NEED TO WRITE
DOWN THE LIST OF BENEFITS

802
00:38:55,801 --> 00:38:58,968
"THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS
VOTED FOR YOU TO HAVE,

803
00:38:59,067 --> 00:39:02,968
AND MR. FALWELL WANTS
TO CONTINUE THOSE FOR A YEAR."

804
00:39:03,067 --> 00:39:04,868
AND I GAVE JERRY,

805
00:39:04,901 --> 00:39:07,968
I GAVE HIM THIS--
THIS THING

806
00:39:08,067 --> 00:39:11,167
WITH TAMMY'S
PINK STATIONARY.

807
00:39:11,200 --> 00:39:16,901
HE GOES TO THE CAMERA
RIGHT THEN.

808
00:39:19,067 --> 00:39:21,200
WE WERE IN OUR HOME
AND CNN WAS ON,

809
00:39:21,234 --> 00:39:25,467
AND, OF COURSE,
WE WERE WATCHING IT.

810
00:39:27,100 --> 00:39:30,801
JIM AND TAMMY GAVE ME
THIS LIST OF THINGS
THEY'D LIKE TO RECEIVE.

811
00:39:30,834 --> 00:39:33,968
JIM'S SALARY,
FOR A LIFETIME,

812
00:39:34,000 --> 00:39:35,067
AT $300,000 PER YEAR.

813
00:39:35,100 --> 00:39:38,400
TAMMY'S SALARY,
FOR A LIFETIME,
$100,000.

814
00:39:38,434 --> 00:39:40,167
SECRETARY FOR ONE YEAR...
PHONE BILL..2 CARS...

815
00:39:40,200 --> 00:39:41,267
HOUSE ON THE LAKE...
SECURITY...

816
00:39:41,300 --> 00:39:44,400
AND THE FURNITURE.
THEY WANT A MAID.

817
00:39:45,133 --> 00:39:48,300
I DON'T SEE
ANY REPENTANCE THERE.

818
00:39:48,334 --> 00:39:51,267
I SEE THE GREED.

819
00:39:51,300 --> 00:39:53,767
I SEE
THE SELF-CENTEREDNESS.

820
00:39:53,801 --> 00:39:58,334
I SEE THE AVARICE
THAT BROUGHT THEM DOWN.

821
00:39:58,367 --> 00:40:00,100
AND FROM
THAT DAY ON,

822
00:40:00,133 --> 00:40:05,100
HE STARTED--
HE STARTED HIS
ATTACK ON JIM.

823
00:40:05,133 --> 00:40:07,000
THE HOMOSEXUALITY STUFF,

824
00:40:07,033 --> 00:40:09,501
THE DARK HOLE WHERE
ALL THE MONEY'S GONE,

825
00:40:09,534 --> 00:40:11,968
AND ALL THAT BALONEY
THAT HE CAME UP WITH.

826
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:14,167
I HAVE SAT ACROSS
THE TABLE FROM MEN

827
00:40:14,200 --> 00:40:18,400
WHO HAVE TOLD ME OF THEIR--
OF YOUR HOMOSEXUAL ADVANCES.

828
00:40:18,434 --> 00:40:24,467
AND SINCE THEN, OF COURSE,
I HAVE LEARNED OF THE
FISCAL IRREGULARITIES.

829
00:40:24,501 --> 00:40:26,000
AND JIM, I MUST TELL YOU

830
00:40:26,033 --> 00:40:28,334
THAT I WOULD BE DOING
A DISSERVICE TO GOD,

831
00:40:28,367 --> 00:40:30,400
AS MUCH AS I LOVE
YOU AND CARE FOR YOU,

832
00:40:30,434 --> 00:40:31,534
AND WILL PRAY FOR YOU,

833
00:40:31,567 --> 00:40:34,133
I WOULD BE DOING
A DISSERVICE TO GOD

834
00:40:34,167 --> 00:40:36,567
AND TO THE CHURCH AT LARGE

835
00:40:36,601 --> 00:40:40,734
TO ALLOW YOU TO COME BACK
HERE NOW OR EVER.

836
00:40:43,267 --> 00:40:47,601
JIM, A LOOK
OF PURE HORROR,

837
00:40:47,634 --> 00:40:51,047
PURE TORTURE
PASSED OVER HIS FACE.

838
00:40:51,067 --> 00:40:56,133
AND HE SAID,
"TAM, IT'S ALL OVER.

839
00:40:56,167 --> 00:40:58,567
I'VE BEEN HAD."

840
00:40:58,601 --> 00:41:00,801
Charles: MY SENSE OF
FALWELL AND OF HIS PEOPLE

841
00:41:00,834 --> 00:41:04,501
AND HOW THEY OPERATED WAS
THEY HAD VERY SHARP KNIVES.

842
00:41:04,534 --> 00:41:07,133
AND THE BAKKERS PROBABLY
WERE A LITTLE NAIVE.

843
00:41:07,167 --> 00:41:11,400
I DON'T KNOW THAT THEY
HAD EVER RUN INTO ANYONE
WHO WAS QUITE SO CUNNING.

844
00:41:11,434 --> 00:41:14,634
THEY WERE MANIPULATIVE,
AND SCHEMING,

845
00:41:14,667 --> 00:41:15,634
BUT HE WAS CUNNING,

846
00:41:15,667 --> 00:41:20,367
AND I THINK CUNNING
TRUMPED SCHEMING THERE.

847
00:41:20,400 --> 00:41:23,501
RuPaul: LESS THAN 3 MONTHS
AFTER FALWELL TOOK OVER,

848
00:41:23,534 --> 00:41:25,467
PTL FILED FOR BANKRUPTCY.

849
00:41:25,501 --> 00:41:27,701
THOUSANDS OF
PTL PARTNERS, DONORS,

850
00:41:27,734 --> 00:41:31,534
AND CREDITORS
LOST MILLIONS OF DOLLARS.

851
00:41:35,267 --> 00:41:39,234
Roe: THEY SOLD IT
FOR 25 CENTS
ON THE DOLLAR,

852
00:41:39,267 --> 00:41:42,200
AND THERE JUST
WASN'T ANY MONEY
FOR THE CREDITORS.

853
00:41:42,234 --> 00:41:44,300
I THINK MR. FALWELL

854
00:41:44,334 --> 00:41:47,334
WANTED TO
DESTROY PTL,
IS WHAT I THINK.

855
00:41:47,367 --> 00:41:52,100
I WOULD LOVE TO SIT
AND LOOK JERRY FALWELL
IN THE EYES

856
00:41:52,133 --> 00:41:53,701
AND SAY, "JERRY,
WHY DON'T YOU JUST

857
00:41:53,734 --> 00:41:58,367
GET IT RIGHT WITH GOD
AND SAY YOU'RE SORRY?"

858
00:41:58,934 --> 00:42:00,400
HE DOESN'T HAVE TO
MAKE IT RIGHT WITH ME,

859
00:42:00,434 --> 00:42:03,801
BECAUSE I'M NOT IN CHARGE
OF WHETHER JERRY FALWELL'S
GOING TO HEAVEN OR HELL.

860
00:42:03,834 --> 00:42:05,334
THAT'S NOT--I'M NOT
IN CHARGE OF THAT.

861
00:42:05,367 --> 00:42:09,334
BUT I SAY HE HAD BETTER
MAKE IT RIGHT WITH GOD.

862
00:42:13,701 --> 00:42:16,901
I WOULD GIVE ANYTHING
TO FACE JERRY,

863
00:42:16,934 --> 00:42:18,767
BUT HE WON'T FACE ME.
I KNOW HE WON'T.

864
00:42:18,801 --> 00:42:21,934
RuPaul: FALWELL NEVER
REPLIED TO TAMMY'S LETTER.

865
00:42:21,968 --> 00:42:23,234
HE HAS, HOWEVER,
GONE ON RECORD

866
00:42:23,267 --> 00:42:27,901
CALLING TAMMY A LOONY
WHOSE ELEVATOR NEVER
WENT TO THE TOP FLOOR.

867
00:42:27,934 --> 00:42:33,047
FALWELL ALSO NEVER RESPONDED
TO THE PRODUCER'S REQUEST

868
00:42:33,067 --> 00:42:34,367
FOR AN INTERVIEW.

869
00:42:34,400 --> 00:42:35,434
ELSEWHERE, HOWEVER,

870
00:42:35,467 --> 00:42:38,501
HE HAS DENIED THAT THE LIST
ON TAMMY'S LETTERHEAD

871
00:42:38,534 --> 00:42:40,701
WAS CREATED
AT HIS SUGGESTION.

872
00:42:40,734 --> 00:42:43,334
HE ALSO MAINTAINS
THAT BAKKER ASKED HIM

873
00:42:43,367 --> 00:42:44,901
TO TAKE OVER THE PTL MINISTRY

874
00:42:44,934 --> 00:42:48,901
AND WAS NEVER PROMISED
HE COULD RETURN.

875
00:42:53,901 --> 00:42:57,534
RuPaul: IN 1989, JIM BAKKER
WENT ON TRIAL FOR FRAUD.

876
00:42:57,567 --> 00:42:58,868
Reporter:
THE GOVERNMENT SAID BAKKER

877
00:42:58,901 --> 00:43:02,067
DELIBERATELY SOLD
MORE THAN TWICE AS MANY
PARTNERSHIPS FOR LODGING

878
00:43:02,100 --> 00:43:03,801
AS THERE
WERE ACCOMMODATIONS,

879
00:43:03,834 --> 00:43:05,534
AND POCKETED
NEARLY $4 MILLION

880
00:43:05,567 --> 00:43:08,234
TO KEEP HIM IN
EXPENSIVE HOMES AND CARS.

881
00:43:08,267 --> 00:43:09,467
James Albert: THIS
WAS A FEDERAL TRIAL.

882
00:43:09,501 --> 00:43:11,567
THERE WERE
NO CAMERAS ALLOWED
IN THE COURTROOM.

883
00:43:11,601 --> 00:43:12,934
WE HAD TO RELY ON
THOSE PRINT JOURNALISTS,

884
00:43:12,968 --> 00:43:16,334
AND PARTICULARLY
THE CHARLOTTE OBSERVER
REPORTERS.

885
00:43:16,367 --> 00:43:18,667
THEN, OF COURSE,
REMEMBER, THE
CHARLOTTE OBSERVER

886
00:43:18,701 --> 00:43:22,968
WON THE PULITZER PRIZE
FOR PUBLIC SERVICE
FOR TOPPLING JIM BAKKER

887
00:43:23,067 --> 00:43:25,434
AND EXPOSING HIM
ONE FULL YEAR

888
00:43:25,467 --> 00:43:29,701
BEFORE THIS JURY
EVER GOT A CHANCE
TO CONSIDER

889
00:43:29,734 --> 00:43:30,868
ANY OF THIS EVIDENCE.

890
00:43:30,901 --> 00:43:35,300
RuPaul: JAMES ALBERT
SPENT 5 YEARS STUDYING
THE PTL TRIAL,

891
00:43:35,334 --> 00:43:37,400
AND WROTE A BOOK
THAT RAISED QUESTIONS

892
00:43:37,434 --> 00:43:39,167
ABOUT HOW THE TRIAL
MIGHT HAVE BEEN

893
00:43:39,200 --> 00:43:41,634
A MISCARRIAGE OF JUSTICE.

894
00:43:41,667 --> 00:43:45,701
WHEN THE DEFENSE
PLAYED A PTL VIDEO

895
00:43:45,734 --> 00:43:47,601
FOR THE JURY TO SEE,

896
00:43:47,634 --> 00:43:52,067
JUDGE POTTER ACTUALLY
STUCK HIS INDEX FINGERS
IN HIS EARS

897
00:43:52,100 --> 00:43:53,067
AND TURNED AWAY.

898
00:43:53,100 --> 00:43:55,200
HE HAS SAID IN
THE COURT MANY TIMES,

899
00:43:55,234 --> 00:43:57,501
"I MAY NOT BE
RULING THIS CORRECTLY,

900
00:43:57,534 --> 00:44:00,267
BUT YOU CAN TAKE IT UP
ON YOUR APPEAL."

901
00:44:00,300 --> 00:44:03,133
AND I FEEL THAT
ANY JUDGE WHO THINKS

902
00:44:03,167 --> 00:44:04,367
THAT WE'RE GONNA
HAVE TO APPEAL

903
00:44:04,400 --> 00:44:06,968
HAS ALREADY
MADE UP HIS MIND
THAT WE'RE GUILTY.

904
00:44:07,067 --> 00:44:10,133
THE JUDGE REFUSED
TO ALLOW THE JURORS

905
00:44:10,167 --> 00:44:14,467
TO BOARD A BUS AND TRAVEL
15 MINUTES TO HERITAGE U.S.A.,

906
00:44:14,501 --> 00:44:16,501
TO SEE WHAT
JIM BAKKER HAD BUILT

907
00:44:16,534 --> 00:44:18,767
WITH ALL THE MONEY
THAT HE RAISED.

908
00:44:18,801 --> 00:44:22,234
IT WAS A TRIAL
NOT ABOUT FRAUD

909
00:44:22,267 --> 00:44:23,367
OR CRIMINAL CONDUCT.

910
00:44:23,400 --> 00:44:26,868
IT WAS A TRIAL
ABOUT LIFESTYLE AND WEALTH.

911
00:44:26,901 --> 00:44:28,067
Reporter: PTL's
NEW MANAGEMENT

912
00:44:28,100 --> 00:44:30,634
ACT CONTINUALLY AMAZED
AT THE OPULENCE

913
00:44:30,667 --> 00:44:32,701
UNDER WHICH JIM
AND TAMMY BAKKER LIVED.

914
00:44:32,734 --> 00:44:35,300
IN FACT, A TRIP THROUGH
THE PRESIDENTIAL SUITE

915
00:44:35,334 --> 00:44:36,634
AT THE HERITAGE
GRAND HOTEL

916
00:44:36,667 --> 00:44:41,701
SHOWS THE BAKKERS LIVED,
ONE COULD EASILY DEDUCE,
QUITE LUXURIOUSLY.

917
00:44:41,734 --> 00:44:42,968
THEY LIVED WELL,

918
00:44:43,067 --> 00:44:45,634
BUT THEY LIVED
NO BETTER THAN
PAT ROBERTSON,

919
00:44:45,667 --> 00:44:47,467
NO BETTER THAN
JERRY FALWELL,

920
00:44:47,501 --> 00:44:48,734
NO BETTER THAN
JIM DOBSON,

921
00:44:48,767 --> 00:44:50,334
'CAUSE I'VE BEEN
IN THEIR HOMES, TOO.

922
00:44:50,367 --> 00:44:53,834
BUT LOOK,
I THINK THE FACT IS

923
00:44:53,868 --> 00:44:55,367
THE BAKKERS HAD BEEN,

924
00:44:55,400 --> 00:44:58,047
FROM PRETTY MUCH
EVERYBODY'S POINT OF VIEW,

925
00:44:58,067 --> 00:44:59,047
PRETTY GREEDY.

926
00:44:59,067 --> 00:45:01,701
IT'S LUDICROUS TO ARGUE

927
00:45:01,734 --> 00:45:05,334
THAT JIM BAKKER
RAISED $158 MILLION

928
00:45:05,367 --> 00:45:07,434
FROM HIS
TELEVISION VIEWERS

929
00:45:07,467 --> 00:45:12,400
TO KEEP $3 MILLION
FOR HIMSELF.

930
00:45:16,067 --> 00:45:17,200
RuPaul: AFTER A 6-WEEK TRIAL,

931
00:45:17,234 --> 00:45:21,801
JIM BAKKER WAS SENTENCED TO
45 YEARS IN FEDERAL PRISON.

932
00:45:21,834 --> 00:45:23,767
I CAN'T IMAGINE HIM
BEING TAKEN INTO CUSTODY,

933
00:45:23,801 --> 00:45:25,968
BUT THAT'S VERY MUCH
IN THE JUDGE'S DISCRETION,

934
00:45:26,067 --> 00:45:29,467
AND THE JUDGE
HAS PROVEN HIMSELF
HARD TO PREDICT.

935
00:45:29,934 --> 00:45:36,334
WITH TODAY'S VERDICT,
REALITY HAS FINALLY
DAWNED FOR JIM BAKKER.

936
00:45:38,334 --> 00:45:43,167
TODAY WAS CERTAINLY AN EXAMPLE
OF GOD'S AMAZING GRACE.

937
00:45:45,100 --> 00:45:47,100
THEY DID HIM LIKE
THEY DONE JESUS,

938
00:45:47,133 --> 00:45:50,934
WITH LEADING HIM
LIKE HE'S A BIG
DRUG PUSHER,

939
00:45:50,968 --> 00:45:51,934
A BIG ROBBER
OR SOMETHING.

940
00:45:51,968 --> 00:45:53,067
THEY HAD
HANDCUFFS ON HIM,

941
00:45:53,100 --> 00:45:57,067
LEADING HIM,
AND HE IS
THE MAN OF GOD.

942
00:45:59,434 --> 00:46:00,834
I HAVE A SONG FOR YOU.

943
00:46:00,868 --> 00:46:07,467
♪ ON CHRIST,
THE SOLID ROCK, I STAND ♪

944
00:46:07,501 --> 00:46:13,534
♪ ALL OTHER GROUND
IS SINKING SAND ♪

945
00:46:13,567 --> 00:46:20,567
♪ ALL OTHER GROUND
IS SINKING SAND ♪

946
00:46:21,167 --> 00:46:23,501
IT'S NOT OVER
TILL IT'S OVER.

947
00:46:23,534 --> 00:46:24,601
RuPaul: THIS
IS THE LAST TIME

948
00:46:24,634 --> 00:46:27,501
TAMMY FAYE WOULD SING
IN PUBLIC FOR QUITE SOME TIME.

949
00:46:27,534 --> 00:46:31,901
MEANWHILE CHARLES SHEPARD
WROTE A BOOK CALLED FORGIVEN,

950
00:46:32,067 --> 00:46:34,047
A SEARING ACCOUNT
OF THE SCANDAL.

951
00:46:34,067 --> 00:46:35,047
[TYPING]

952
00:46:35,067 --> 00:46:38,634
SHEPARD WAS ASKED IF HE
WOULD MET WITH TAMMY FAYE.

953
00:46:38,667 --> 00:46:40,367
HE AGREED.

954
00:46:42,234 --> 00:46:43,968
SO 12 YEARS
AFTER THE VERDICT,

955
00:46:44,067 --> 00:46:47,601
TAMMY CONFRONTED CHARLES
FOR THE FIRST TIME.

956
00:46:47,634 --> 00:46:48,901
I WAS THEIR, CHARLIE.

957
00:46:48,934 --> 00:46:50,067
I KNOW HOW IT HAPPENED.

958
00:46:50,100 --> 00:46:52,467
I KNOW JIM BAKKER
IS NOT A CROOK.

959
00:46:52,501 --> 00:46:56,067
I KNOW THAT AFTER
25 YEARS IN FRONT OF
THE TELEVISION CAMERAS,

960
00:46:56,100 --> 00:46:59,047
WE DID NOT STEAL MONEY
AND YOU AND I--

961
00:46:59,067 --> 00:47:00,667
I WANT TO HEAR YOU SAY,
"YOU STOLE MONEY."

962
00:47:00,701 --> 00:47:04,501
I DON'T FEEL I WROTE THINGS
THAT WERE UNTRUE.
HMM.

963
00:47:04,534 --> 00:47:06,047
CERTAINLY NOT KNOWING
THEY WERE,

964
00:47:06,067 --> 00:47:09,267
AND EVEN NOW, I DON'T KNOW
OF ANYTHING I WROTE
THAT WAS UNTRUE.
MM-HMM.

965
00:47:09,300 --> 00:47:10,701
DID YOU WRITE THAT
MILLIONS WERE MISSING?

966
00:47:10,734 --> 00:47:12,801
I DON'T EVER REMEMBER
WRITING THAT.

967
00:47:12,834 --> 00:47:17,767
YOU SAID--WHAT YOU SAID
WAS A BIG, DEEP HOLE...

968
00:47:17,801 --> 00:47:20,634
MILLIONS MISSING.

969
00:47:20,667 --> 00:47:21,634
W-WHY?

970
00:47:21,667 --> 00:47:23,634
ALL I WANT TO KNOW
IS JUST WHY?

971
00:47:23,667 --> 00:47:25,601
WHICH QUESTION
SHOULD I ANSWER FIRST?

972
00:47:25,634 --> 00:47:26,601
ON ALL OF THEM!

973
00:47:26,634 --> 00:47:28,334
I CAN'T UNDERSTAND,
WHAT DID WE DO?

974
00:47:28,367 --> 00:47:32,334
FIRST OF ALL, I DON'T--
I'M NOT HERE TO SAY--
A JUDGE AND JURY.

975
00:47:32,367 --> 00:47:33,400
BECAUSE, LISTEN.

976
00:47:33,434 --> 00:47:37,567
I COULD TURN AROUND
AND--AND--AND--AND
PUT PTL DOWN

977
00:47:37,601 --> 00:47:40,267
IF I WANT TO,
JUST LIKE THE NEWS DID,

978
00:47:40,300 --> 00:47:42,067
BUT I WAS THERE
AND I LIVED IT

979
00:47:42,100 --> 00:47:43,901
AND ONE THING I KNOW
ABOUT JIM BAKKER--

980
00:47:43,934 --> 00:47:44,901
HE WAS AN HONEST MAN.

981
00:47:44,934 --> 00:47:46,868
AND ONE THING I KNOW
ABOUT THE PTL ORGANIZATION,

982
00:47:46,901 --> 00:47:51,047
IT WAS AN HONEST,
TRUTHFUL ORGANIZATION.

983
00:47:51,067 --> 00:47:52,801
RuPaul: TAMMY
WANTED AN APOLOGY.

984
00:47:52,834 --> 00:47:55,968
CHARLES WANTED AN AUTOGRAPH.

985
00:47:56,067 --> 00:47:56,968
OH, YEAH. I--I--I...

986
00:47:57,067 --> 00:47:59,234
I BROUGHT SOME COPIES
OF MY BOOK.

987
00:47:59,267 --> 00:48:00,567
HEY, GREAT.

988
00:48:00,601 --> 00:48:02,133
I WANTED TO GIVE YOU,
BUT I WANTED TO GET YOU
TO AUTOGRAPH SOME...

989
00:48:02,167 --> 00:48:03,901
I WILL.

990
00:48:03,934 --> 00:48:05,047
MY SCHOOL HAS GOT
AN AUCTION

991
00:48:05,067 --> 00:48:07,234
FOR THE GRADUATE WOMEN
IN BUSINESS GROUP.
OH, SURE.

992
00:48:07,267 --> 00:48:08,601
I THOUGHT
IT WOULD BE A KICK

993
00:48:08,634 --> 00:48:09,601
IF I GIVE THEM THAT
TO AUCTION OFF.

994
00:48:09,634 --> 00:48:12,100
OK. ALL RIGHT.

995
00:48:14,334 --> 00:48:16,434
DIDN'T KNOW YOU WERE
GOING TO A SIGNING,
DID YOU, TAMMY?

996
00:48:16,467 --> 00:48:17,767
NO, I DIDN'T.

997
00:48:17,801 --> 00:48:19,834
Man: TAMMY, WHAT
DID YOU WRITE?

998
00:48:19,868 --> 00:48:20,834
HA HA HA!

999
00:48:20,868 --> 00:48:24,367
BUT, HEY, CHARLES,
YOU'RE FORGIVEN.

1000
00:48:24,400 --> 00:48:25,501
HA HA HA!

1001
00:48:25,534 --> 00:48:27,834
♪ I'M GOING
TO LOVE MY ENEMIES ♪

1002
00:48:27,868 --> 00:48:31,801
♪ DO GOOD TO THOSE
WHO ARE BAD TO ME ♪

1003
00:48:31,834 --> 00:48:34,067
♪ GOING TO LOVE... ♪

1004
00:48:37,367 --> 00:48:39,701
WELL, IF YOU CAME
TO SEE ME CRY,

1005
00:48:39,734 --> 00:48:41,047
WELL, YOU GOT YOUR WISH.

1006
00:48:41,067 --> 00:48:43,734
Woman: WOULD YOU LIKE
TO MAKE A STATEMENT
IN FRONT OF THE CAMERAS?

1007
00:48:43,767 --> 00:48:45,234
WELL, I WANT TO SAY
I LOVE MY HUSBAND,

1008
00:48:45,267 --> 00:48:47,767
MY FAITH IS STILL
STRONG IN THE LORD.

1009
00:48:47,801 --> 00:48:50,701
I STILL FEEL THERE'S
NOTHING TOO HARD FOR GOD,

1010
00:48:50,734 --> 00:48:53,868
AND I'M STANDING ON CHRIST,
A SOLID ROCK.

1011
00:48:53,901 --> 00:48:55,734
RuPaul: WITH A HUSBAND
IN PRISON,

1012
00:48:55,767 --> 00:48:58,901
A RUNAWAY DAUGHTER,
AND A TROUBLED SON,

1013
00:48:58,934 --> 00:49:02,100
TAMMY STRUGGLED
TO MAKE IT ON HER OWN.

1014
00:49:02,133 --> 00:49:07,133
BUT IN 1992, JIM AND TAMMY'S
DREAM ENDED...IN DIVORCE.

1015
00:49:07,167 --> 00:49:09,701
I WAS TOTALLY ALONE
AND HAD NOTHING, NO ONE.

1016
00:49:09,734 --> 00:49:12,601
EVERYONE HAD TURNED
THEIR BACK AGAINST ME
ONE MORE TIME,

1017
00:49:12,634 --> 00:49:15,801
AND I FELT LIKE
A WOMAN WITHOUT A COUNTRY.

1018
00:49:15,834 --> 00:49:19,434
IT'S SO OFTEN TRUE
THAT CHRISTIANS ARE

1019
00:49:19,467 --> 00:49:22,234
ONE ARMY THAT KILLS
THEIR WOUNDED.

1020
00:49:22,267 --> 00:49:23,234
HA HA. WE DON'T--

1021
00:49:23,267 --> 00:49:25,534
WE DON'T TRY TO NURSE THEM
BACK TO HEALTH.

1022
00:49:25,567 --> 00:49:28,868
AND I DON'T KNOW
OF ANY WOMAN IN OUR TIME

1023
00:49:28,901 --> 00:49:33,033
WHO HAS BEEN SO RIDICULED,
PUT DOWN, MALIGNED.

1024
00:49:33,067 --> 00:49:34,934
REALLY, I EQUATE HER

1025
00:49:34,968 --> 00:49:36,033
WITH HILLARY CLINTON...

1026
00:49:36,067 --> 00:49:41,167
BECAUSE THESE 2 WOMEN
HAVE BOTH SUFFERED
TREMENDOUSLY

1027
00:49:41,200 --> 00:49:44,734
BY THE THINGS THAT
THEIR HUSBANDS MAY HAVE DONE.

1028
00:49:44,767 --> 00:49:46,901
HA. AND YET SHE JUST
KEEPS GOING.

1029
00:49:46,934 --> 00:49:50,167
Choir:
♪ I'LL KEEP CLIMBING ♪

1030
00:49:50,200 --> 00:49:53,033
♪ I'LL KEEP CLIMBING ♪

1031
00:49:53,067 --> 00:49:55,968
♪ UP THE MOUNTAIN ♪

1032
00:49:56,000 --> 00:49:58,467
♪ UP THAT MOUNTAIN ♪

1033
00:49:58,501 --> 00:50:01,067
♪ AND I'LL MAKE IT ♪

1034
00:50:01,100 --> 00:50:04,000
♪ I'M GOING TO MAKE IT ♪

1035
00:50:04,033 --> 00:50:06,200
RuPaul: 18 MONTHS
AFTER HER DIVORCE,

1036
00:50:06,234 --> 00:50:09,367
TAMMY SCANDALIZED
THE CHURCH AND THE MEDIA

1037
00:50:09,400 --> 00:50:10,467
WHEN SHE REMARRIED.

1038
00:50:10,501 --> 00:50:13,901
HER NEW HUSBAND WAS THE MAN
WHO PAID OFF JESSICA HAHN,

1039
00:50:13,934 --> 00:50:15,601
THE MAN WHO BUILT
HERITAGE U.S.A.,

1040
00:50:15,634 --> 00:50:20,501
AND THE MAN WHO JIM BAKKER
CALLED HIS BEST FRIEND...

1041
00:50:20,534 --> 00:50:21,634
ROE MESSNER.

1042
00:50:21,667 --> 00:50:24,868
Roe: EVERYBODY
LIKES TO SAY THAT
WAS PLANNED, YOU KNOW,

1043
00:50:24,901 --> 00:50:27,634
AND THAT ROE AND TAMMY
HAD THIS BIG DEAL GOING

1044
00:50:27,667 --> 00:50:30,868
WHILE HE WAS IN
CHARLOTTE BUILDING PTL.

1045
00:50:30,901 --> 00:50:33,067
NONE OF THAT'S TRUE.

1046
00:50:33,100 --> 00:50:34,734
ALL OF A SUDDEN, I...

1047
00:50:34,767 --> 00:50:35,901
LIKED TAMMY, YOU KNOW?

1048
00:50:35,934 --> 00:50:42,334
AND WE STARTED
TALKING TOGETHER
A LITTLE BIT.

1049
00:50:42,367 --> 00:50:43,367
UM...

1050
00:50:43,400 --> 00:50:47,501
AND IT JUST
SORT OF HAPPENED
LIKE THAT, REALLY.

1051
00:50:47,534 --> 00:50:48,501
RuPaul:
DIVORCED AND REMARRIED,

1052
00:50:48,534 --> 00:50:51,367
TAMMY WAS REJECTED
BY CHRISTIAN BROADCASTING,

1053
00:50:51,400 --> 00:50:53,467
SO SHE TURNED
TO SECULAR TELEVISION,

1054
00:50:53,501 --> 00:50:55,400
COURTING EVEN MORE
CONTROVERSY

1055
00:50:55,434 --> 00:50:59,734
BY HOSTING A TALK SHOW
WITH AN OPENLY GAY COHOST.

1056
00:50:59,767 --> 00:51:02,634
Both: ♪ WE'RE NOT
WHAT YOU'D EXPECT ♪

1057
00:51:02,667 --> 00:51:05,067
♪ WE'RE A CRAZY,
KOOKY DUET ♪

1058
00:51:05,100 --> 00:51:08,634
♪ WE'RE A RECIPE
YOU COULDN'T BAKE UP ♪

1059
00:51:08,667 --> 00:51:10,567
♪ 3 TIMES THE LAUGHS ♪

1060
00:51:10,601 --> 00:51:12,868
♪ AND 10 TIMES
THE MAKEUP ♪

1061
00:51:12,901 --> 00:51:15,234
I THINK GAY PEOPLE
LIKE TAMMY BECAUSE

1062
00:51:15,267 --> 00:51:16,234
TAMMY LIKES GAY PEOPLE.

1063
00:51:16,267 --> 00:51:18,734
AND SHE'S ONE
OF THE ONLY CHRISTIANS

1064
00:51:18,767 --> 00:51:21,601
IN THE WORLD
