IN THE HOSPITAL...

1120
00:53:45,601 --> 00:53:47,634
THAT WAS...

1121
00:53:48,200 --> 00:53:51,400
I THINK THE CLOSEST--
CLOSEST...

1122
00:53:51,767 --> 00:53:55,267
I'VE EVER BEEN
TO MY MOTHER.

1123
